lbirs eSports defeated alohasquad 2:0 on February 22, 2026, demonstrating ability to secure clean victories", "BALU appears to have minimal competitive presence in recent tournament records, suggesting potential skill gap", "Ilbirs has prior EPL experience competing in Season 2, providing familiarity with the tournament environment"], "side_no_case": ["Ilbirs eSports suffered a 0:2 shutout loss to NAVI Junior on February 24, 2026, indicating significant competitive gaps", "Ilbirs lost 1:2 to Rune Eaters on February 20, 2026, showing inconsistent performance in close matches", "Limited recent tournament results for Ilbirs suggest potential organizational or roster instability"], "key_context": ["Match is part of EPL Group A, a Tier 3 European competitive circuit", "Data from February-March 2026 shows Ilbirs competing in EPL Championship Season 2", "Search results contain limited information about BALU's roster, recent form, or head-to-head record with Ilbirs", "No explicit head-to-head match history between Ilbirs eSports and BALU found in provided results", "BO3 format requires winning 2 maps, making individual map performance critical"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-07T09:43:59.400775Z"}}, "resolution": {"resolved_at": "2026-04-07T15:00:00Z", "winning_side": "YES", "final_yes_price": 1.0, "checked_at": "2026-04-07T13:40:41.383155+00:00", "source": "gamma_api"}, "analysis": {"kind": "correct_pass", "summary": "Correct PASS \u2014 council was unsure, median prob 62%; winner was YES", "agents_with_winner": [{"agent": "The Bull", "prob": 0.68, "side": "YES", "side_conf": 0.72, "key_factor": "Ilbirs eSports' demonstrated map-winning capability and EPL experience against an opponent with minimal competitive visibility in recent tournament records."}, {"agent": "The Sentiment Analyst", "prob": 0.62, "side": "YES", "side_conf": 0.58, "key_factor": "Rational"}, {"agent": "The Domain Specialist", "prob": 0.62, "side": "YES", "side_conf": 0.58, "key_factor": "Ilbirs eSports sho