{"run_id": "1068dc17-178c-44ff-b638-9472c2624ada", "timestamp": "2026-04-07T19:20:35.628002+00:00", "legacy": false, "result": {"market": {"id": "1909348", "question": "LoL: Misa Esports vs BIG (BO3) - EMEA Masters Playoffs", "resolution_criteria": "This market refers to the LoL Lower bracket semifinal match between Misa Esports and BIG in the EMEA Masters Playoffs, initially scheduled for April 7 at 2:00PM ET.\n\nThis market will resolve to \"Misa Esports\" if Misa Esports win the match against BIG.\n\nThis market will resolve to \"BIG\" if BIG win the match against Misa Esports.\n\nIf the match is canceled (not played at all), ends in a tie, or is delayed beyond 7 days from the scheduled date without a winner determined, this market will resolve to 50-50. \n\nIf the match begins but is not completed, and one team wins due to the opponent's forfeiture, disqualification, or walkover, this market will resolve to the team who wins. \n\nIf the match ends in a forfeit, disqualification, or walkover (team withdraws before the start and the other wins automatically), this market will resolve to 50-50. \n\nThe resolution source for this market will be official information from https://gol.gg/esports/home. However, if https://gol.gg/esports/home has not published final results within 2 hours after the event\u2019s conclusion, a consensus of credible reporting may be used instead including video evidence.\n\nIn cases where a team\u2019s listed name includes minor discrepancies from the resolution source, this market will resolve based on the underlying real-world match rather than exact name matching. Recognizable abbreviations, alternate or erroneous spellings, sponsor tags, affiliate or academy designations, regional identifiers, and minor formatting differences will be treated as referring to the same team, provided the intended team can be clearly and uniquely identified within the relevant competition. If a listed team name has no reasonable connection to any participating team, or if it matches or could reasonably refer to another team in the same competition such that the intended team cannot be unambiguously determined, this market will resolve 50-50.", "end_date": "2026-04-08T00:00:00Z", "event_start_time": "2026-04-07T18:00:00Z", "yes_price": 0.585, "volume_usd": 54818.01486700003, "category": "league-of-legends"}, "verdicts": [{"agent_name": "The Rules Lawyer", "probability": 0.5, "confidence_yes": 0.25, "confidence_no": 0.25, "rationale": "The briefing explicitly states 'search results contain information about Misa Esports' recent competitive performance in VALORANT tournaments... but do not provide specific information about a Misa Esports vs BIG League of Legends match in EMEA Masters 2026 Winter Playoffs.' All team performance data provided relates to VALORANT (VCL T\u00fcrkiye, VCL EMEA), not League of Legends. No information on Misa Esports' LoL roster, recent LoL results, or playoff seeding in EMEA Masters. No information whatsoever on BIG's LoL team, roster, recent form, or competitive standing. No head-to-head match history between Misa Esports and BIG in LoL. Without comparative team strength, recent form data, or roster information for either team, there is no evidentiary basis to assign a probability above or below 50. The market price (YES 58%, NO 42%) may reflect trader knowledge not present in this briefing, but per rules, analysis must be based ONLY on the provided briefing. Event timing is TODAY (resolves in ~5 hours), so reversal risk is irrelevant \u2014 the match is imminent or already occurring. Resolution criteria are clear and unambiguous: Misa Esports winning resolves YES, BIG winning resolves NO. Confidence is low on both sides due to complete absence of relevant LoL competitive data for either team.", "key_factor": "Critical data gap: Briefing contains only VALORANT performance data for Misa Esports and zero information on either team's LoL roster, recent form, head-to-head history, or competitive 