ng this is their first matchup", "Both teams in mid-table standing (M80 ranked 7th, NRG Academy 6th) with multiple rounds remaining to determine final playoff seeding"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-07T20:13:07.548749Z"}}, "resolution": {"resolved_at": "2026-04-08T02:00:00Z", "winning_side": "YES", "final_yes_price": 1.0, "checked_at": "2026-04-08T07:12:50.657227+00:00", "source": "gamma_api"}, "analysis": null}
