across all roles.", "probability_yes": 0.79, "probability_no": 0.20999999999999996, "probability_source": "synthetic_mirror"}, {"agent_name": "The Base-Rate Statistician", "probability": 0.76, "confidence_yes": 0.78, "confidence_no": 0.62, "rationale": "EDG's undefeated week-1 record in VCT China 2026 Stage 1 is the strongest current signal; this tier of early-season momentum correlates with ~75-80% win probability in subsequent group matches Most recent direct matchup (Jan 2025) shows EDG's 13-4 dominant victory with all five players posting positive K/D and high ACS (CHICHOO 280, cb 260, Jieni7 220, nobody 210, Smoggy 191); this baseline is only ~3 months old and reflects current roster stability Shanghai Masters 2025 stats reinforce EDG's roster form: CHICHOO averaged 305 ACS, cb 293, demonstrating elite fragging; Trace Esports data from same period unavailable, limiting countervailing evidence BO3 format introduces modest uncertainty; Trace's Aug 2024 win (13-10) proves competitive capability, but that match predates both teams' current roster consolidation and meta evolution Trace Esports shows inconsistent recent form (mixed 2024-2025 results, no fresh 2026 data provided); lack of current-season context weakens the NO case Market price at 82% YES is only 6 points above base-rate estimate (76%), suggesting modest overvaluation of EDG; confidence in YES slightly tempered by BO3 variance and limited Trace 2026 context EVENT TIMING: Match resolves TODAY in ~6 hours; no time for major roster/meta shifts; reversal from 82% market odds would require Trace executing near-perfect preparation against undefeated opponent\u2014low probability with zero evidence of such preparation in briefing Confidence gap (YES 78 vs NO 62) reflects strong EDG evidence but meaningful Trace data vacuum; NO confidence capped at 62 due to absence of 2026 season performance metrics for Trace and single unfavorable H2H outcome", "key_factor": "In VCT China regional play, teams demonstrating u