ted recent head-to-head or comparative data available for FC Famalic\u00e3o Esports to assess relative strength", "Mixed performance trajectory with losses following some wins suggests instability"], "key_context": ["Match format is Best of 3 (BO3) in NODWIN Clutch Series Play-In Group C stage", "Tournament is online/regional EU qualifier-level competition (B-tier classification)", "MANA roster underwent significant changes in June 2026, acquiring KS- lineup with players ammar, Caleyy, gejmzilla, BledarD, cerber", "Recent matches from March-April 2026 show MANA competing actively in multiple tournament formats concurrently", "FC Famalic\u00e3o Esports information extremely limited in search results; no recent match history or roster details provided"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-09T01:54:57.797866Z"}}, "resolution": {"resolved_at": "2026-04-09T14:20:00Z", "winning_side": "YES", "final_yes_price": 1.0, "checked_at": "2026-04-09T17:03:28.049327+00:00", "source": "gamma_api"}, "analysis": {"kind": "missed_opportunity", "summary": "Missed opportunity \u2014 council favored YES at 67% (6/7 agents, 1 high-conv) but PASSed. Reason: YES-side confidence too low: 64% (need \u226567%)", "agents_with_winner": [{"agent": "The Bull", "prob": 0.76, "side": "YES", "side_conf": 0.72, "key_factor": "MANA's demonstrated BO3 win capability and group-stage dominance in CCT EU Play-In (2-0, 2-0 victories) versus FC Famalic\u00e3o's complete absence from recent competitive record."}, {"agent": "The Rules Lawyer", "prob": 0.72, "side": "YES", "side_conf": 0.68, "key_factor": "Severe asymmetry in available competitive data: MANA has documented recent form, but FC Famalic\u00e3o Esports has virtually no searchable match history or roster information in briefing, making comparative strength assessment unreliable."}, {"agent": "The Base-Rate Statistician", "prob": 0.72, "side": "YES", "side_conf": 0.68, "key_factor": "In EU-regional qualifier-tier CS2 BO3 matches, teams with established roster