, which undervalues Akimbo's wins in Dust2.us Eagle Masters and map pool familiarity; however, the CCT-specific loss to FarmVille is a strong countervailing signal that Akimbo struggles specifically in THIS tournament format or bracket. Time-to-reversal: with ~5 hours remaining and match at 23:30 UTC today, major roster changes or lineup surprises are unlikely, but tactical adjustments and map selection advantage remain in play; confidence in either outcome is constrained by missing preparation data. Black swan: if Akimbo made an undisclosed roster change or player is unavailable due to illness/clash, OR if InControl has identified a map pool exploit (e.g., Inferno/Mirage dominance by a substitute), the 0-2 loss to FarmVille becomes a red herring and Akimbo's apparent form weakness reverses sharply.", "key_factor": "Akimbo's recent 0-2 loss to FarmVille in the same CCT tournament signals internal roster/tactical issues or player substitutions not reflected in older match data, while InControl may have rotated in a high-impact player or resolved a tactical vulnerability that explains their recent win streak.", "probability_yes": 0.32, "probability_no": 0.6799999999999999, "probability_source": "synthetic_mirror"}], "final_score": 0.5079155672823219, "no_score": 0.5097206703910614, "edge": 0.1329155672823219, "no_edge": -0.11527932960893861, "recommendation": "PASS", "confidence_level": "MEDIUM", "signal_type": null, "pass_reason": "Contrarian call: council prob 51% < 70% threshold; Contrarian call: YES-side confidence 54% < 80% threshold", "expected_roi": 0.0, "briefing": {"market": {"id": "1921911", "question": "Counter-Strike: Akimbo Esports vs InControl (BO3) - CCT North America Series #4 Group A", "resolution_criteria": "This market refers to the Counter-Strike Elimination match between Akimbo Esports and InControl in the CCT North America Series #4 Group A, initially scheduled for April 9 at 5:30PM ET.\n\nThis market will resolve to \"Akimbo Esports\" if Akimbo 