connection to any participating team, or if it matches or could reasonably refer to another team in the same competition such that the intended team cannot be unambiguously determined, this market will resolve 50-50.", "end_date": "2026-04-10T16:00:00Z", "event_start_time": "2026-04-10T10:00:00Z", "yes_price": 0.655, "volume_usd": 1040829.1547310007, "category": "league-of-legends"}, "verdicts": [{"agent_name": "The Rules Lawyer", "probability": 0.62, "confidence_yes": 0.72, "confidence_no": 0.48, "rationale": "RESOLUTION CONDITION: Hanwha Life Esports must win the BO3 match against BNK FearX in LCK Rounds 1-2 on April 10, 2026. HLE REGULAR SEASON RECORD: 2-1 in LCK 2026 Rounds 1-2 with +2 game differential; clean 2-0 victory over BRION (10th place) demonstrates execution capability in round-robin format. BFX RECORD DISPARITY: Briefing heavily weights LCK Cup 2026 playoff data (wins vs. Dplus KIA 2-0, competitive vs. Gen.G, mixed T1 performance 2-2). Very limited LCK 2026 regular season data provided; cannot directly compare current form. RECENT FORM CONFLICT: HLE lost 2-1 to KT Rolster (implied recent match); HLE also lost 0-3 to Gen.G in LCK Cup. BFX beat Dplus KIA 2-0 in LCK Cup but lost 1-3 to Gen.G. Both teams show volatility at elite tier. CHAMPION POOL & META: Pantheon (BFX jungle, 57.1% WR) and Rumble (39% pick rate BFX, 39% vs HLE) are pivotal contested picks. Neeko (42% ban rate vs BFX) indicates threat recognition. HLE shows flexible pool (Vayne, Taliyah, Lulu, Bard) but limited win-rate context for these picks in this dataset. INDIVIDUAL PERFORMANCE: BFX jungle (Raptor, 3.6 KDA, 75% KP) appears stronger than HLE jungle (Zephyr, 2.0 KDA, 65.4% KP). Mid lane stats less clear (FIESTA 2.7 KDA vs. mid context missing for HLE). DATA QUALITY ASYMMETRY: HLE data focuses on regular season (2-1 record clearly stated). BFX data predominantly LCK Cup playoff matches; playoff performance does not reliably predict round-robin regular season results. Tournament play di