lity_no": 0.38, "probability_source": "synthetic_mirror"}, {"agent_name": "The Sentiment Analyst", "probability": 0.68, "confidence_yes": 0.72, "confidence_no": 0.58, "rationale": "Market price of 66% YES aligns closely with briefing evidence: HLE's 2-1 record, positive game differential, and clean 2-0 over BRO in Week 1 provide concrete regular season data. HLE ranked 3rd in LCK 2026 standings with positive trajectory, while BFX lacks comparable regular season record\u2014most data is from LCK Cup playoffs, a different format/timeframe. BFX strength signals (beats DK 2-0, Pantheon 57% WR) are real but limited in scope; these are cup results, not current season regular play. HLE's 0-3 loss to Gen.G in LCK Cup is concerning but not disqualifying\u2014different tournament, different pressure context; regular season 2-1 record is more recent/relevant. Data asymmetry favors HLE narrative: multiple recent regular season games (BRO 2-0, KT loss, overall 2-1 record) vs BFX data dominated by older cup performance. 66% pricing reflects reasonable confidence in the more consistently documented team; no obvious crowd panic or euphoria detected. Confidence_yes at 72: HLE's regular season record is concrete; BFX's recent regular season data is sparse, limiting counter-evidence quality. Confidence_no at 58: BFX's individual player strengths (Raptor's Pantheon, draft flexibility) are undeniable, but lack of recent regular season context creates assessment uncertainty. Market appears correctly pricing HLE as slight favorite without overcommitting\u2014the 34% NO odds give BFX reasonable upset potential, not dismissal.", "key_factor": "Rational", "probability_yes": 0.68, "probability_no": 0.31999999999999995, "probability_source": "synthetic_mirror"}, {"agent_name": "The Domain Specialist", "probability": 0.62, "confidence_yes": 0.72, "confidence_no": 0.55, "rationale": "HLE's established 2-1 LCK 2026 regular season record (3rd place, +2 differential) is direct same-season baseline;