s team cohesion or coordination issues"], "side_no_case": ["Karmine Corp Blue has only 1 game sample on both key champions (Xin Zhao, Corki), making win rate data unreliable", "Esprit Sh\u014dnen's small sample sizes (1-0 records) are insufficient to establish genuine team superiority", "Both teams have extremely limited match data from LFL 2026 Spring regular season in provided materials", "Win rates on individual champions do not always translate to team match performance in Best-of-1 format"], "key_context": ["LFL 2026 Spring Regular Season - matches are Best-of-1 format with higher variance than series", "Both teams show very small sample sizes (1-2 games visible per team), early in season trajectory", "Current standings place both teams in lower-middle tier of LFL standings, suggesting comparable skill levels", "Champion-specific statistics are based on 1 game each for most picks, limiting predictive value", "No recent head-to-head match history between these two teams is visible in provided data"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-10T16:53:25.435728Z", "price_history": {"token_id": "40195179736706488399510873859352782506275249816851775633991701737238794291667", "data_points": 25, "weighted_avg": 0.21506202422337015, "change_1w_pp": 10.500000000000002, "change_24h_pp": 7.500000000000001, "volatility_24h": 1.6438920136009407, "direction": "RISING", "sharp_moves": [], "fetched_at": "2026-04-10T16:53:25.819462Z"}}}, "resolution": {"resolved_at": "2026-04-10T23:50:00Z", "winning_side": "NO", "final_yes_price": 0.0, "checked_at": "2026-04-11T14:27:46.942091+00:00", "source": "gamma_api"}, "analysis": null}
{"run_id": "cd7393cf-0144-4bfc-907b-bf64fece8c12", "timestamp": "2026-04-10T19:44:46.490989+00:00", "legacy": false, "result": {"market": {"id": "1856207", "question": "Valorant: Gentle Mates vs Karmine Corp (BO3) - VCT EMEA Group Alpha", "resolution_criteria": "This market refers to the Valorant match between Gentle Mates and Karmine Corp in the VCT EMEA Group Alpha, initially scheduled for April 10 at 2:00PM ET.\n\nThis market will resolve to \"Gentle Mates\" if Gentle Mates win the match against Karmine Corp.\n\nThis market will resolve to \"Karmine Corp\" if Karmine Corp win the match against Gentle Mates.\n\nIf the match is canceled (not played at all), ends in a tie, or is delayed beyond 7 days from the scheduled date without a winner determined, this market will resolve to 50-50. \n\nIf the match begins but is not completed, and one team wins due to the opponent's forfeiture, disqualification, or walkover, this market will resolve to the team who wins. \n\nIf the match ends in a forfeit, disqualification, or walkover (team withdraws before the start and the other wins automatically), this market will resolve to 50-50. \n\nThe resolution source for this market will be official information from https://vlr.gg. However, if https://vlr.gg has not published final results within 2 hours after the event\u2019s conclusion, a consensus of credible reporting may be used instead including video evidence.\n\nIn cases where a team\u2019s listed name includes minor discrepancies from the resolution source, this market will resolve based on the underlying real-world match rather than exact name matching. Recognizable abbreviations, alternate or erroneous spellings, sponsor tags, affiliate or academy designations, regional identifiers, and minor formatting differences will be treated as referring to the same team, provided the intended team can be clearly and uniquely identified within the relevant competition. If a listed team name has no reasonable connection to any participating team, or if it matches or could reasonably refer to another team in the same competition such that the intended team cannot be unambiguously determined, this market will resolve 50-50.", "end_date": "2026-04-11T00:30:00Z", "event_start_time": "2026-04-10T18:30:00Z", "yes_price": 0.755, "volume_usd": 93127.11153500006, "category": "valorant", "clob_token_ids": ["37700793285201716671638873618148495356677277895795156963859864646833056709542", "87779714902843230246171432547899207995419399799244164744942468600671087644416"]}, "verdicts": [{"agent_name": "The Rules Lawyer", "probability": 0.76, "confidence_yes": 0.42, "confidence_no": 0.28, "rationale": "MARKET SIGNAL DOMINANCE: The YES price has risen sharply from ~52% (7-day EMA) to 76% current, with a +13.0pp jump on Apr 10 at 19:42 UTC (match day, ~6 hours before scheduled 2:00 PM ET start). This suggests late information flow favoring Gentle Mates, but the source of that signal is unknown. DATA VACUUM: The briefing contains detailed statistics for FNATIC vs Team Vitality players (kaajak, crashies, Boaster, Alfajer, Chronicle, Derke, Jamppi) and transfer news from April 2026, but NO performance metrics, roster composition, recent form, or match history for Gentle Mates or Karmine Corp. GENTLE MATES SIGNAL: One sentence mentions Gentle Mates has 'the world's best Yoru player in marteen' with a double-Duelist approach (bipo on Neon, marteen on Phoenix/Waylay). This is a qualitative strength signal but lacks concrete recent match data or head-to-head context. KARMINE CORP SIGNAL: Zero specific information provided about Karmine Corp's roster, playstyle, recent results, or individual player strength. MARKET STRUCTURE: YES trades at 76%, NO at 24%. The spread (76+24=100%) suggests tight orderbook; volume of $93,127 indicates modest but real interest. The sharp +13.0pp move on match day suggests late-breaking information, possibly team announcements, coach statements, or betting sharp money positioning. TIMING CRITICALITY: Market resolves in ~5 hours (TODAY event timing, end date 2026-04-11 00:30 UTC). If the match has NOT yet started or begun moments ago, the 76% probability reflects either: (a) early match result (if live), (b) pre-match sentiment lock-in, or (c) information asymmetry among traders. CONFIDENCE ASYMMETRY: confidence_yes=42 because the market signal is strong and unambiguous (76% is decisive), but grounded entirely in unknown late-day price movement and a single Gentle Mates player strength mention, not team-level performance data. confidence_no=28 because there is virtually NO data to assess whether Karmine Corp can compete; the case for Karmine Corp is pure silence, making it impossible to evaluate defensive arguments or upset potential. RESOLUTION CRITERIA CLARITY: Criteria are unambiguous \u2014 YES resolves if Gentle Mates win; NO if Karmine Corp win. 50-50 applies only if match is canceled, delayed >7 days, ends in tie, or forfeits/DQ before start. Standard win conditions result in clean YES/NO resolution. MECHANISM RISK (SECONDARY): VLR.gg is the primary source; 2-hour fallback to credible reporting exists. This is a major esports tracking site and unlikely to have publication delays. Team name ambiguity risk is low (Gentle Mates and Karmine Corp are distinct, recognizable team names). Risk of mechanism failure \u2248 2-5%; does not materially alter core probability. PROBABILITY INFERENCE: Given the 76% market price on match day, with modest recent volatility and a known strong individual player signal for Gentle Mates (marteen Yoru), but no data on Karmine Corp or broader team form, the market appears to be pricing Gentle Mates as slight-to-moderate favorite. Absent contradictory briefing data, the 76% market price is the strongest available signal. Setting probability_score at 76 (matching market) reflects deference to price discovery in a two-sided market with real money exposure.", "key_factor": "Briefing document contains no meaningful performance data for either Gentle Mates or Karmine Corp; probability estimate relies entirely on market price signal rather than team strength assessment.", "probability_yes": 0.76, "probability_no": 0.24, "probability_source": "synthetic_mirror"}, {"agent_name": "The Bull", "probability": 0.72, "confidence_yes": 0.68, "confidence_no": 0.35, "rationale": "MARKET MOMENTUM: YES side has surged +24.5pp over 7 days with a sharp +13.0pp spike 2 hours before match time (Apr 10 19:42 UTC), indicating informed traders or real-time intelligence favoring Gentle Mates. This recent acceleration is the strongest signal available. VOLUME & CONVICTION: $93,127 in trading volume with 148 data points for YES vs 44 for NO shows 3.4x more trading activity backing Gentle Mates\u2014typical of markets with clearer favorites or better-informed players. ROSTER STRENGTH HINT: Brief mentions Gentle Mates as 'boasting the world's best Yoru player in marteen'\u2014a notable competitive credential suggesting the team has at least one elite-tier player, which elevates their overall competitive tier. TECHNICAL PRICING: 76% YES vs 24% NO reflects substantial market consensus. Such a 3:1 spread typically reflects genuine competitive disparity rather than blind speculation in esports betting. UNDERDOG WEAKNESS: NO side (Karmine Corp) has NO positive signals in the briefing\u2014no player credentials mentioned, no tactical innovations noted, no recent momentum. Absence of evidence is weakness in esports prediction. TIMING ASYMMETRY: With match resolving in ~5 hours, the +13.0pp YES move 2 hours ago likely reflects late-stage intel (team readiness, scrim results, roster updates, or technical advantages scouted). Limited time for reversal. DATA GAP ACKNOWLEDGMENT: Briefing lacks head-to-head history, recent series records, or detailed performance metrics for either team\u2014this creates uncertainty but does not shift probability away from market consensus which prices YES at 76%. NO REVERSAL CATALYSTS: For Karm