ext": ["LIT 2026 Winter Split regular season - BO1 format eliminates comebacks and increases variance", "Average game duration across split is 31:58; HMBLE games vary significantly from 24:11 to 56:43", "No direct StoneHenge Esports performance data available in search results", "HMBLE has faced top-tier competition (EKO Esports, Colossal Gaming) during the split", "Tournament average is 36 kills per game across 28 games played"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-10T12:13:44.501791Z"}}, "resolution": {"resolved_at": "2026-04-10T23:45:00Z", "winning_side": "YES", "final_yes_price": 1.0, "checked_at": "2026-04-11T14:27:48.552525+00:00", "source": "gamma_api"}, "analysis": null}
{"run_id": "926a6b2f-8a67-45b7-a2f6-18a7977ba123", "timestamp": "2026-04-10T12:16:33.528290+00:00", "legacy": false, "result": {"market": {"id": "1934747", "question": "Counter-Strike: ZOTIX vs bankaPEPSI (BO3) - CCT Europe Contenders #4 Playoffs", "resolution_criteria": "This market refers to the Counter-Strike Lower bracket quarterfinal 2 match between ZOTIX and bankaPEPSI in the CCT Europe Contenders #4 Playoffs, initially scheduled for April 10 at 2:15PM ET.\n\nThis market will resolve to \"ZOTIX\" if ZOTIX win the match against bankaPEPSI.\n\nThis market will resolve to \"bankaPEPSI\" if bankaPEPSI win the match against ZOTIX.\n\nIf the match is canceled (not played at all), ends in a tie, or is delayed beyond 7 days from the scheduled date without a winner determined, this market will resolve to 50-50. \n\nIf the match begins but is not completed, and one team wins due to the opponent's forfeiture, disqualification, or walkover, this market will resolve to the team who wins. \n\nIf the match ends in a forfeit, disqualification, or walkover (team withdraws before the start and the other wins automatically), this market will resolve to 50-50. \n\nThe resolution source for this market will be official information from https://hltv.org. However, if https://hltv.org has not published final results within 2 hours after the event\u2019s conclusion, a consensus of credible reporting may be used instead including video evidence.\n\nIn cases where a team\u2019s listed name includes minor discrepancies from the resolution source, this market will resolve based on the underlying real-world match rather than exact name matching. Recognizable abbreviations, alternate or erroneous spellings, sponsor tags, affiliate or academy designations, regional identifiers, and minor formatting differences will be treated as referring to the same team, provided the intended team can be clearly and uniquely identified within the relevant competition. If a listed team name has no reasonable connection to any participating team, or if it matches or could reasonably refer to another team in the same competition such that the intended team cannot be unambiguously determined, this market will resolve 50-50.", "end_date": "2026-04-11T00:15:00Z", "event_start_time": "2026-04-10T18:15:00Z", "yes_price": 0.325, "volume_usd": 1788.619252, "category": "counter-strike"}, "verdicts": [{"agent_name": "The Rules Lawyer", "probability": 0.32, "confidence_yes": 0.25, "confidence_no": 0.25, "rationale": "CRITICAL DATA GAP: Briefing document contains zero relevant Counter-Strike, esports, or team-specific information. Search results returned only generic sports news (MLB, NBA, NFL, UFC) with no CCT Europe Contenders tournament data. NO TEAM INTELLIGENCE: No information available on ZOTIX or bankaPEPSI rosters, recent form, win rates, head-to-head history, map pool strength, or competitive standing in CCT Europe. NO TOURNAMENT CONTEXT: Unknown seeding, bracket position, which teams advanced to this lower bracket quarterfinal 2 match, or relative strength of competitors. NO META DATA: No information on current Counter-Strike patch, map pool, meta strategy, or any factors that could differentiate team capabilities. EVENT TIMING CONCERN: Market resolves in ~12 hours (TODAY event timing). If match has not yet occurred, it is imminent. If match has already occurred, official results should be available on HLTV within 2 hours; market pricing at 32% YES suggests either live/recent uncertainty or pre-match assessment. PROBABILITY ALIGNMENT WITH MARKET: Current market price of 32% YES / 68% NO is reflected in probability_score. This pricing likely reflects market consensus rather than derived analysis, as no briefing data supports differentiation. CONFIDENCE SEVERELY LIMITED: Both confidence_yes and confidence_no set to 25 due to complete absence of data on either side. Cannot meaningfully evaluate ZOTIX's likelihood of victory without competitive intelligence on both teams. RE