e with a 0-2 record (0-4 map score, -20 map differential), while RIZON sits in 4th place with a 1-1 record (3-3 map score, +5 map differential). This matchup represents a critical opportunity for the struggling AKA HERO to avoid further losses, while RIZON seeks to maintain their mid-table position in the tournament.", "side_yes_case": ["RIZON has lost recent matches to stronger teams (1-2 vs CGN Esports, 1-2 vs eSports Cologne)", "AKA HERO has nothing to lose and may play with reduced pressure as the last-place team", "Head-to-head context shows this is a winnable matchup for AKA HERO relative to top-tier competitors", "RIZON's inconsistent form (1-1 record) suggests vulnerability against any opponent"], "side_no_case": ["AKA HERO is 0-2 in the tournament with a severe -20 map differential indicating poor competitive level", "RIZON has a positive map differential (+5) and demonstrated the ability to win maps against stronger opponents", "RIZON is positioned 4th in standings while AKA HERO is in last place, reflecting a significant skill gap", "AKA HERO's 0-4 map record suggests systemic team issues that are unlikely to resolve in a single match"], "key_context": ["Best-of-3 format (BO3) provides multiple opportunities for either team to demonstrate form", "Stage 2 group stage round-robin format where all teams play each other; multiple matches remain for both squads", "RIZON previously defeated eSports Cologne 2-1 in Round 1, showing they can win against similar-tier opposition", "Tournament is VALORANT Challengers 2026 DACH: Evolution (regional developmental competition)", "Recent match data from April 4-7, 2026 shows current competitive snapshot with limited historical precedent"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-10T20:23:10.244841Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "63317511318852451830924919082348661053132082195600798287967736683774674916899", "data_points": 22, "weighted_avg": 0.33294250472393, "change_1w_pp": -14.500000000000002, "change_24h_pp": 4.999999999