mance in their recent match against S2G Esports, with players like influx (1.70 rating) and JN3v1cEEE (1.40 rating) performing strongly. The match context is VCL T\u00fcrkiye Birlik Group B, indicating this is a group stage competition in the Turkish Valorant league.", "side_yes_case": ["Fire Flux Esports showed strong individual performances in recent matches with multiple players posting 1.35+ ratings", "Fire Flux players influx (Jett, 1.70 rating) and JN3v1cEEE (Skye, 1.40 rating) demonstrated high-impact fragging ability", "Fire Flux maintained positive round differentials (+/- metrics) in recent competitive matches", "No direct evidence of Ghosts' recent form or roster strength available in search results"], "side_no_case": ["Fire Flux Esports' controller player Docent posted significantly lower ratings (0.61-0.78) suggesting potential mid-round control weaknesses", "Fire Flux's Raze player musz3kk showed inconsistent performance (1.45 rating but heavily variable 0.57-0.93 split)", "Limited recent match data available for Fire Flux; statistics shown are from 2025 Challengers matches", "No performance data provided for Ghosts team, making comparative strength assessment impossible"], "key_context": ["Match is part of VCL T\u00fcrkiye Birlik Group B, a structured group stage in Turkish Valorant Challengers circuit", "Search results primarily contain data from Eternal Fire vs S2G and Fire Flux vs S2G matches, not directly from the requested matchup", "Fire Flux roster includes: JN3v1cEEE, kabzi, influx, musz3kk, and Docent based on available match data", "No head-to-head history or prior Ghosts vs Fire Flux records available in search results", "Tournament appears to be 2025-2026 Valorant Challengers season based on match timestamps and format"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-11T15:04:38.953480Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "75523098566991978720090544936986592672988076617302214854922572530206641783712", "data_points": 39, "weighted_avg": 0.3182209911248567