ual ratings: Mada\u00f4 achieved 1.59 rating with 308 ACS, Darxcioo posted 1.25 rating despite variance, indicating higher firepower", "Lost Puppies struggled with economy management and losing close rounds: team won only 3 of 8 full buy rounds against Natus Vincere Junior, indicating resource disadvantage in critical moments", "Consistency concerns: Lost Puppies players showed rating volatility across maps (e.g., Darxcioo's 2.25 vs 0.24 swings), suggesting inconsistent performance at tournament level"], "key_context": ["Tournament format: VCL NORTH//EAST Group Stage, indicating early tournament rounds with competitive standing implications", "Head-to-head context: Prior match data shows direct experience between these teams with quantifiable performance gaps", "Clarification needed: 'baigiau' not clearly identified in search results; team name may refer to Lost Puppies or another roster configuration", "Match is Best-of-3 format, allowing for map variety and strategic adaptation between rounds"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-12T17:08:23.091143Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "42618902632221865858674892337781748483539973811984948528244189069972994090235", "data_points": 12, "weighted_avg": 0.6825626439451185, "change_1w_pp": 8.499999999999996, "change_24h_pp": 8.499999999999996, "volatility_24h": 3.319364670864263, "direction": "RISING", "sharp_moves": [{"timestamp": "2026-04-12T17:07:43Z", "delta_pp": 10.499999999999998}]}, "no": {"token_id": "69873399765992681682305562885604694741327863669294235854372767056723404535578", "data_points": 3, "weighted_avg": 0.3066530170554257, "change_1w_pp": -9.5, "change_24h_pp": -9.5, "volatility_24h": 13.081475451951126, "direction": "FALLING", "sharp_moves": [{"timestamp": "2026-04-12T17:07:48Z", "delta_pp": -13.999999999999998}]}, "fetched_at": "2026-04-12T17:08:23.385634Z"}}}, "resolution": {"resolved_at": "2026-04-12T21:30:00Z", "winning_side": "YES", "final_yes_price": 1.0, "checked_at": "2026-04-13T00:24:16.087283+00