il 12, 2026.", "side_yes_case": ["REBORN undefeated (2-0) with dominant map differential (+26) indicates superior form and team cohesion", "REBORN has recorded 4 consecutive map wins with efficient performance across multiple opponents", "FUT Academy's only played match (vs Galatasaray) shows less extensive testing against tournament competition", "REBORN defeated Fire Flux 2-0 showing consistency in high-intensity matchups", "Group B standings position REBORN as favorites with clearer tournament trajectory"], "side_no_case": ["FUT Academy maintains perfect record in their single match (2-0 vs Galatasaray) with impressive +17 map differential", "FUT Academy has played fewer matches, meaning less opportunity for losses and potentially fresher strategic preparation", "Both teams have limited head-to-head history in current season; single match data insufficient for reliable prediction", "FUT Academy's selective play could indicate calculated preparation specifically for stronger opponents", "Tournament format allows both teams to adjust strategies between matches; April 12 provides 1-week preparation window"], "key_context": ["VCL T\u00fcrkiye: Birlik Stage 2 is a single-round robin group stage (April 4-20) with top 4 teams advancing; all matches are Best-of-3", "Week 1 matches were played April 4-7; REBORN vs FUT Academy is scheduled for April 12 (5-day gap allowing tactical adjustments)", "Group B has 5 teams total; standings show competitive distribution with 3 teams separated by single match win", "REBORN vs ghosts (0-2) and FUT Academy vs Galatasaray (2-0) represent matches against mid-tier competition; direct head-to-head will test both teams against equal opponents", "Map veto records indicate both teams using similar agent pools (Omen, Neon, Sova, Viper) suggesting meta-aligned strategic approaches"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-12T17:13:38.150500Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "9822865994701399879685967327846064721309770956941048004226804187059794739