ion to any participating team, or if it matches or could reasonably refer to another team in the same competition such that the intended team cannot be unambiguously determined, this market will resolve 50-50.", "end_date": "2026-04-13T00:00:00Z", "event_start_time": "2026-04-12T18:00:00Z", "yes_price": 0.165, "volume_usd": 18658.817252000004, "category": "league-of-legends", "clob_token_ids": ["23112111793070847599115402817728229257766063245223522311276732447025126027212", "86972266250139614762232150031416460023304095469498053840656807846448532092741"]}, "verdicts": [{"agent_name": "The Rules Lawyer", "probability": 0.16, "confidence_yes": 0.25, "confidence_no": 0.28, "rationale": "RESOLUTION CONDITION: Team Heretics must win the BO3 match against Karmine Corp in LEC Regular Season, scheduled April 12, 1:15 PM ET (now reported as TODAY, resolving ~7 hours hence). CRITICAL DATA GAP: Briefing contains exclusively LES (Spanish regional league) results for 'Los Heretics', NOT LEC (European Championship) data. These are different competitive tiers; LES strength does not reliably predict LEC performance. HERETICS DATA (LES only): Defeated LUA Gaming 2-0 in April 2026 Spring and 2-0 in February 2026 Winter; demonstrates dominance in Spanish competition but provides zero LEC-level baseline. KARMINE CORP DATA: Completely absent from briefing. Zero performance metrics, roster information, recent form, or head-to-head history available for analysis. MARKET SIGNAL: Current YES price (16%) suggests market participants possess external knowledge (team standings, meta matchups, player form, etc.) not contained in this briefing document. CONFIDENCE ASYMMETRY: confidence_yes set to 25 (low) because Heretics' LES dominance does not reliably extrapolate to LEC, and no comparative LEC data exists. confidence_no set to 28 (slightly higher but still low) because Karmine Corp's competitive tier and capabilities are entirely unknown; market odds suggest NO is favored, but briefing provides no substantive basis to validate that view. TIME-TO-REVERSAL: Event is LIVE/IMMINENT (~7 hours to resolution). A reversal requiring new information or a major upset is highly unlikely given the match is about to begin or is in progress. This reinforces reliance on pre-match market consensus rather than briefing data. RESOLUTION CRITERIA CLARITY: Criteria text is unambiguous\u2014binary win condition, forfeits resolve 50-50, cancellation/delay >7 days resolves 50-50, walkover mid-match resolves to winning team. Name matching clause accounts for 'Los Heretics' vs 'Team Heretics' discrepancy. MECHANIC RISK: gol.gg is designated resolution source with 2-hour fallback to credible reporting; minimal mechanism risk given match is live/imminent. FINAL ASSESSMENT: Probability_score anchored to market consensus (16%) due to severe data insufficiency in briefing. Both confidence scores remain low because briefing provides no substantive evaluation of either team's LEC capability, head-to-head dynamics, or current form in the relevant competition tier.", "key_factor": "Briefing data contains exclusively Spanish LES (Liga Espa\u00f1ola) competition information and zero substantive data on either team's LEC performance, Karmine Corp's capabilities, or head-to-head record; market odds (16% YES) appear to reflect knowledge external to this briefing.", "probability_yes": 0.16, "probability_no": 0.84, "probability_source": "synthetic_mirror"}, {"agent_name": "The Bull", "probability": 0.18, "confidence_yes": 0.25, "confidence_no": 0.72, "rationale": "MARKET STRUCTURE: NO (Karmine Corp) is priced at 84% with rising momentum (+34.5pp over 7 days), indicating strong consensus favoring Karmine Corp to win. YES (Heretics) at 16% reflects heavy underdog status. DATA GAP CRITICAL: Briefing contains almost exclusively LES (Spanish regional league) data about 'Los Heretics,' NOT LEC data. The market question specifies 'LEC Regular Season' but search results show Heretics competing in Spanis