cture means this is not an elimination match for Bar\u00e7a, but for DNSTY (lower bracket participant or head-to-head tiebreaker). RESOLUTION CRITERIA CLARITY: Clear resolution path if match completes; forfeit/walkover conditions map to 50-50; no ambiguity in team name matching (both names unambiguous). CONFIDENCE ASYMMETRY JUSTIFICATION: High confidence_yes (62) supported by documented Bar\u00e7a playoff performance, individual metrics, and roster stability; low confidence_no (45) due to near-complete absence of DNSTY competitive data\u2014cannot meaningfully evaluate NO side's win probability without roster/form information. TIMING: Event marked TODAY, resolving ~7 hours; match may already be in progress or concluded by briefing timestamp (2026-04-12 17:19 UTC). Market shares will trade to ~$0.01/$0.99 once outcome is determined, even if VLR.gg publication is delayed. PROBABILITY SYNTHESIS: Bar\u00e7a's documented Stage 2 success, stable roster, and stronger available evidence outweigh lack of DNSTY context; market consensus at 69% is justified by asymmetric data quality. Adjust probability to 68 to reflect NO-side uncertainty without overstating it.", "key_factor": "Insufficient data on DNSTY roster strength, recent form, and head-to-head matchup history creates asymmetric confidence; briefing lacks competitive context for NO side.", "probability_yes": 0.68, "probability_no": 0.31999999999999995, "probability_source": "synthetic_mirror"}, {"agent_name": "The Bull", "probability": 0.72, "confidence_yes": 0.78, "confidence_no": 0.42, "rationale": "FAVORED SIDE STRENGTHS: Bar\u00e7a eSports demonstrated clear playoff execution in Stage 2 with dominant victories over UCAM (2-0) and DSY (3-1), proving ability to close out series in knockout format. ROSTER QUALITY: Documented individual performances from stonezy (Cypher specialist, 0.75 K/D with strong map control stats) and Hassan (Neon operator, 0.58 K/D showing consistent fragging) suggest mechanically sound core ca