apt bans/picks across maps; one map win + momentum swing could flip series. Confidence in YES (72) reflects strong historical record and market consensus, but confidence in NO (54) is artificially suppressed by data gaps\u2014we have almost NO current-season intel on Leviat\u00e1n's actual strength or roster health this year, which should lower conviction in the YES narrative.", "key_factor": "Leviat\u00e1n executes a fresh meta adaptation or roster substitution (e.g., stand-in player, tactical innovation targeting Cloud9's map pool weaknesses) that cloud9 has not prepared for, converting historical matchup dominance into irrelevance in a single BO3.", "probability_yes": 0.62, "probability_no": 0.38, "probability_source": "synthetic_mirror"}], "final_score": 0.57, "no_score": 0.42426315789473684, "edge": 0.0, "no_edge": -0.005736842105263207, "recommendation": "BUY YES", "confidence_level": "HIGH", "signal_type": "HIGH VALUE", "pass_reason": "", "expected_roi": 0.7543859649122808, "briefing": {"market": {"id": "1700801", "question": "Valorant: Cloud9 vs Leviat\u00e1n Esports (BO3) - VCT Americas Stage 1 Group Alpha", "resolution_criteria": "This market refers to the Valorant match between Cloud9 and Leviat\u00e1n Esports in the VCT Americas Stage 1 Group Alpha, initially scheduled for April 12 at 5:00PM ET.\n\nThis market will resolve to \"Cloud9\" if Cloud9 win the match against Leviat\u00e1n Esports.\n\nThis market will resolve to \"Leviat\u00e1n Esports\" if Leviat\u00e1n Esports win the match against Cloud9.\n\nIf the match is canceled (not played at all), ends in a tie, or is delayed beyond 7 days from the scheduled date without a winner determined, this market will resolve to 50-50. \n\nIf the match begins but is not completed, and one team wins due to the opponent's forfeiture, disqualification, or walkover, this market will resolve to the team who wins. \n\nIf the match ends in a forfeit, disqualification, or walkover (team withdraws before the start and the other wins automatically), this market will resolve to 50-50. \n\nThe resolution source for this market will be official information from https://vlr.gg. However, if https://vlr.gg has not published final results within 2 hours after the event\u2019s conclusion, a consensus of credible reporting may be used instead including video evidence.", "end_date": "2026-04-13T03:00:00Z", "event_start_time": "2026-04-12T21:00:00Z", "yes_price": 0.57, "volume_usd": 56754.110753999994, "category": "valorant", "clob_token_ids": ["22857921000622385995940539269549464587304217497730044339578261329919998819734", "63767421704783462614534417404247857545846937996242126282531639248699219357929"]}, "key_facts": ["Group Stage: April 10<sup>th</sup> - May 10<sup>th</sup>, 2026.", "Each Group has 6 teams; All matches are Bo3.", "Top Valorant esports teams rankings list and tiers in Europe.", "Stats, score, streams, and VODs from ENVY vs.", "LOUD - Week 1 match of VCT 2026: Americas Stage 1 Valorant event.", "Riot has announced the details of its new partnership format that will begin next season, which features a tournament-centric model that also looks to", "The first week of VCT Pacific Stage 1 has wrapped up, with a rematch of the Masters Santiago grand final headlining the action.", "Cloud9 roster, upcoming matches, results, rank, stats, and achievements.", "100 Thieves roster, upcoming matches, results, rank, stats, and achievements.", "Gen.G roster, upcoming matches, results, rank, stats, and achievements."], "news_summary": "Cloud9 and Leviat\u00e1n Esports are scheduled to compete in VCT 2026 Americas Stage 1 Group Alpha during the April 10 - May 10, 2026 group stage period. The match will be played in best-of-three format. Historical data from 2023-2025 shows Cloud9 has consistently defeated Leviat\u00e1n in head-to-head matchups across multiple tournaments. Leviat\u00e1n has struggled with consistency, showing mixed results against other top Americas teams while Cloud9 maintains stronger overall positioning.", "side_yes_case": ["Cloud9 dominates historical head-to-head record against Leviat\u00e1n (multiple wins across 2023-2025 seasons)", "Cloud9 consistently rated higher in competitive rankings among North American teams", "Leviat\u00e1n's track record shows significant losses to top-tier opponents and inconsistent performance", "Cloud9 demonstrated stronger performance metrics and rating differential in recent matches"], "side_no_case": ["Leviat\u00e1n secured wins against competitive opponents in 2024-2025 season (G2 Esports, NRG, KR\u00dc Esports)", "Leviat\u00e1n achieved positive results in Esports World Cup 2025 matches showing capability against strong teams", "Best-of-three format creates opportunity for upset potential even against favored opponents", "Tournament performance can vary from historical records; fresh season offers reset conditions"], "key_context": ["VCT 2026 Americas Stage 1 group stage runs April 10 - May 10 with two 6-team single round-robin groups", "All matches are best-of-three format; top 4 teams from each group advance", "Cloud9 and Leviat\u00e1n historical matchups show consistent pattern from 2023-2025 seasons", "Both teams are competing in new 2026 season with potentially updated rosters and meta shifts", "Tournament-centric VCT model changes announced for 2027 may affect 2026 competitive dynamics"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-12T17:22:22.466143Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "22857921000622385995940539269549464587304217497730044339578261329919998819734", "data_points": 49, "weighted_avg": 0.554387501974987, "change_1w_pp": 2.9999999999999916, "change_24h_pp": 0.0, "volatility_24h": 2.5166114784235805, "direction": "RISING", "sharp_moves": []}, "no": {"token_id": "63767421704783462614534417404247857545846937996242126282531639248699219357929", "data_points": 44, "weighted_avg": 0.44184690695006823, "change_1w_pp": -3.0000000000000027, "change_24h_pp": -0.5000000000000004, "volatility_24h": 2.25462