mpetitive teams including 100 Thieves (1-0, 2-0) and KR\u00dc Esports (1-0, 2-0) who have already begun their campaigns, while Sentinels and Evil Geniuses have started poorly at 0-1 and 0-2 respectively. All matches in the stage are best-of-three format with the top 4 teams from each group advancing.", "side_yes_case": ["FURIA has not yet played while stronger teams like 100 Thieves and KR\u00dc have established momentum early", "NRG's schedule shows early losses or disadvantageous positioning relative to other group competitors", "Brazilian team FURIA may have regional performance advantages in Americas competition", "Both teams remain unproven in this stage, making early performances critical for playoff positioning"], "side_no_case": ["NRG represents a competitive North American organization with established infrastructure and talent", "Match outcome is fundamentally uncertain given both teams' 0-0 status in Group Omega", "FURIA's early placement in the standings table suggests they may not yet have played strong opposition", "Group features multiple evenly-matched teams, making upsets and competitive matches likely"], "key_context": ["Match scheduled for VCT 2026: Americas Stage 1, Group Omega single-round robin format", "Best-of-three format with top 4 teams from the 6-team group advancing to playoffs", "100 Thieves and KR\u00dc Esports have already won their opening matches (2-0), setting competitive bar", "Both FURIA and NRG currently at 0-0 records with matches pending throughout April-May 2026 window", "No direct head-to-head history provided in available search results"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-12T17:29:42.358075Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "19619144710005688162337636538387641315293149791732518823572585768209109072582", "data_points": 116, "weighted_avg": 0.3384777392852128, "change_1w_pp": -6.0, "change_24h_pp": -3.4999999999999973, "volatility_24h": 0.6510065466717851, "direction": "STABLE", "sharp_moves": []}, "no": {"token_id": "884553