y determined, this market will resolve 50-50.", "end_date": "2026-04-13T05:45:00Z", "event_start_time": "2026-04-12T23:45:00Z", "yes_price": 0.7, "volume_usd": 1198.9512939999997, "category": "counter-strike", "clob_token_ids": ["45456157639330080416851379966305032643009230656164803033000944926823766017722", "104587518505070310744169761509034924290540321996670547585641076408554587318515"]}, "key_facts": ["CCT South America 2026 Challengers #1 is an online South American CS2 tournament organized by CCT.", "This C-Tier tournament is a Valve Tier 2 event taking", "This is the points changes if the result was the only thing counted, the final impact of the match on the VRS, will also take into account factors such as", "World ranking HLTV regional ranking Regional rankings Global Valve ranking Valve ranking Global Valve Regional ranking Regional Valve ranking Global Valve", "Choose theme:\n\nLiveESL Challenger League Season 51 North America Cup 3\n\nInControl ()\n\nregain ()\n\n03:00AMPGL Bucharest 2026\n\nMIBR\n\n3DMAX\n\n06:00AMPGL Bucharest 2026\n\nAstralis\n\nEYEBALLERS\n\n09:00AMPGL Bucharest 2026\n\nFUT\n\nB8\n\n12:00PMPGL Bucharest 2026\n\nThe MongolZ\n\nPARIVISION\n\n05:30PMCCT Season 3 North America Series 4\n\nAkimbo\n\nInControl\n\nHe's back!", "April 8, 2026 07:51PM\n\nWritten by Mnmzzz\n\n# Breaking: ScreaM returns to action six years after hanging up the mouse\n\nThe 31-year-old fragger will look to roll back the clock on the Franco-Belgian roster.", "[...] ScreaM's road back to competitive Counter-Strike first began in 2025 when he joined FUT as a sixth-man and streamer alongside the organization's short-lived French lineup.", "Since then, ScreaM has been streaming and playing in a handful of smaller French events while working to get back into form.", "The Clutchain organization has been making a number of inroads into CS2 in recent weeks, picking up this roster today while also signing the former Imperial Valkyries/Pigeons roster in early April.", "Clut