y updates, (3) scrim form in final 48h, (4) head-to-head map pool overlap. This absence screams data insufficiency for a 13-hour event. YES price at 60% implies market confidence in HEROIC Academy, yet current price (60%) differs sharply from 7-day weighted avg (48%), suggesting recent bullish information is NEW and may be overweighted if based on unconfirmed rumors or scrim leaks. Academy designation for HEROIC suggests potential roster fluidity \u2014 players may rotate in/out for development. A key player benched for academy match could materially harm their coherence even if aggregate stats are strong. Phantom's Polish roster stability (no academy tag) may provide psychological edge in high-pressure playoff match \u2014 academy teams sometimes lack championship mentality in knockout formats. NO confidence (72%) is higher than YES (55) because: HEROIC Academy's 2-0 rate (38.7% vs 20%) and lower OT% (2.7% vs 5.8%) are STATISTICALLY ROBUST signals of cleaner execution. But both confidence scores are capped below 80 due to missing critical 48h data (health, scrim results, tactical innovation) that could flip a modest edge.", "key_factor": "HEROIC Academy player illness, roster substitution, or last-minute lineup change forcing a stand-in into a playoff match, negating their superior recent form and consistency metrics.", "probability_yes": 0.38, "probability_no": 0.62, "probability_source": "synthetic_mirror"}], "final_score": 0.43555831265508677, "no_score": 0.5890136986301371, "edge": -0.1594416873449132, "no_edge": 0.18401369863013706, "recommendation": "PASS", "confidence_level": "MEDIUM", "signal_type": null, "pass_reason": "Contrarian call: council prob 59% < 70% threshold; Contrarian call: NO-side confidence 52% < 80% threshold", "expected_roi": 0.0, "briefing": {"market": {"id": "1937816", "question": "Counter-Strike: Phantom vs HEROIC Academy (BO3) - European Pro League Series 6 Playoffs", "resolution_criteria": "This market refers to the Counter-Strike Qua