dentified within the relevant competition. If a listed team name has no reasonable connection to any participating team, or if it matches or could reasonably refer to another team in the same competition such that the intended team cannot be unambiguously determined, this market will resolve 50-50.", "end_date": "2026-04-13T16:00:00Z", "event_start_time": "2026-04-13T10:00:00Z", "yes_price": 0.09, "volume_usd": 333.967915, "category": "dota-2", "clob_token_ids": ["10493225198220446241761818462224589953775137593528097534696767856077730395414", "57143094430720641698646991800541391258325749032923034616590381218772925104743"]}, "verdicts": [{"agent_name": "The Rules Lawyer", "probability": 0.08, "confidence_yes": 0.35, "confidence_no": 0.78, "rationale": "RESOLUTION CONDITION: ALIS VENTORUS must win the BO3 match to resolve YES; Nigma Galaxy must win to resolve NO. NIGMA GALAXY FORM ANALYSIS: Recent results show mixed-to-poor performance\u20140-2 loss to Virtus.pro (DreamLeague S28, 14 days ago), 0-3 loss in DreamLeague Division 2 Season 3 (February 2026, Tier 2), recent wins vs Pipsqueak+4 (2-1) but broader pattern of qualifier underperformance. ALIS VENTORUS DATA GAP: Minimal information available in briefing. Team appears absent from major tier-1 qualifier results listed, suggesting either lower tier participation or recent formation. This creates significant uncertainty about relative skill. MARKET PRICING SIGNAL: 91% NO / 9% YES reflects strong market confidence in Nigma Galaxy victory. Recent sharp movement (\u00b120pp on Apr 13 00:00/01:00 UTC) suggests new information arrived; current stable 9% YES suggests market consensus has settled. TEAM VISIBILITY ASYMMETRY: Nigma Galaxy has documented recent qualifier history across multiple tournaments (PGL, ESL One, DreamLeague). ALIS VENTORUS has no visible comparable tournament history in briefing, suggesting potential skill/resource gap favoring Nigma Galaxy. HEAD-TO-HEAD: No historical matchup record provided. Direct