ompeting in the DreamLeague Western Europe Closed Qualifier Playoffs (BO3 format). Nigma Galaxy has shown recent mixed performance with 2-1 wins against Pipsqueak+4 in ESL One Birmingham qualifiers but losses to Virtus.pro (0-2) in DreamLeague Season 28 qualifiers. Limited information is available about ALIS VENTORUS in the search results, making direct comparative analysis difficult.", "side_yes_case": ["Nigma Galaxy has recent playoff experience with 2-1 victory over Pipsqueak+4 in ESL One Birmingham 2026 qualifiers (5-6 days ago)", "ALIS VENTORUS appears to lack visibility in tier-1 qualifier results, suggesting potential skill gap", "Nigma Galaxy demonstrated ability to win series in recent closed qualifiers despite broader inconsistency"], "side_no_case": ["Nigma Galaxy lost 0-2 to Virtus.pro in DreamLeague Season 28 qualifiers 14 days ago", "Nigma Galaxy has poor overall qualifier results with multiple 0-2 losses across DreamLeague, PGL Wallachia, and other events in January 2026", "Team showed 0-3 loss in DreamLeague Division 2 Season 3 (Tier 2, February 2026) indicating current form decline", "Inconsistent performance pattern with more losses than wins in recent qualifier tournaments"], "key_context": ["DreamLeague Western Europe Closed Qualifier Playoffs format suggests this is a high-stakes qualifier match", "Nigma Galaxy's recent qualifier participation across multiple tournaments (PGL, ESL One, DreamLeague) indicates active competition schedule", "No head-to-head historical record between ALIS VENTORUS and Nigma Galaxy available in search results", "Match appears to be recent/upcoming based on DreamLeague Season 28 qualifier context (January 2026 timeframe)", "Limited public data on ALIS VENTORUS performance makes prediction challenging"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-13T09:30:54.690162Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "10493225198220446241761818462224589953775137593528097534696767856077730395414", "data_points": 19, "weighted_avg": 0.1088506861055