en Four Angry Men | | | 0-1-1-0 | 14-15 | -1 | 3p |\n| 4.", "| EDward GamingEDward Gaming EDward Gaming | | | 0-1-0-0 | 8-6 | +2 | 2p |\n| 5."], "news_summary": "In CN League 2026 Kickoff Group A Playday 1, Kingzone and One Coin are competing in a best-of-one match. The standings show Kingzone (KINGZERO eSports) currently at 0-1 record with 13-13 round differential and 2 points, while One Coin sits at 0-0-0-1 with a 2-7 round differential and 0 points after their opening match. All Gamers leads the group at 2-0, while My Queen is 1-0. This matchup represents an important opportunity for both teams to improve their early tournament positioning.", "side_yes_case": ["Kingzone has a positive round differential (0) versus One Coin's negative differential (-5) despite similar records", "Kingzone secured 2 points in their first match, showing they can compete at this level", "One Coin has scored only 2 rounds across their opening match, indicating significant tactical or execution issues"], "side_no_case": ["One Coin's 2-7 round loss shows they struggled significantly in their first match", "Kingzone is also winless (0-1) with a tied round differential, indicating their own difficulties", "Both teams have performed poorly relative to All Gamers (2-0) and My Queen (1-0) in the group"], "key_context": ["Best-of-one format (BO1) means higher variance; single map performance determines outcome", "This is Playday 1 of group stage; early season form may not be fully stabilized", "One Coin is 0-1 coming into this match after their opening loss", "Kingzone is 0-1-0-1 record structure suggests they may have had a close match or unusual result in first game"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-13T10:03:34.894929Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "33011244255775670328909075702140247770619922863016771697721010768396394438097", "data_points": 3, "weighted_avg": 0.7524480806915221, "change_1w_pp": 5.000000000000004, "change_24h_pp": 5.000000000000004, "volatility_24h": 2.828427124746192