2 | 1 | 33:06 | Fnatic vs Astralis | 12.12 | WEEK3 | LEC Summer 2022 |\n| WIN | 1-0 | Blue | 19 | 98.7 | 11 | 4 | BDS | 22 | 92.2 | 5 | 4 | 54:04 | Team BDS vs Fnatic | 12.11 | WEEK2 | LEC Summer 2022 |\n| LOSS | 0-1 | Blue | 5 | 49.3 | 3 | 2 | MAD | 11 | 56.9 | 9 | 2 | 30:39 | MAD Lions vs Fnatic | 12.11 | WEEK2 | LEC Summer 2022 |", "Logo\n\n###### General\n\n###### Specific\n\n# FNC vs.", "G2 @ LEC 2026 Spring\n\nFnatic\nG2 Esports\nG2 Esports\n\n### Overall Team Stats\n\nFnatic\n\nG2 Esports\nG2 Esports\n\n### Overall Player Performance\n\nFnatic\nJax\nSion\nKennen\nCS per minute\nZaahen\nPantheon\nVi\nCS per minute\nOrianna\nAurora\nTaliyah\nCS per minute\nCorki\nYunara\nXayah\nCS per minute\nNami\nLulu\nAlistar\nCS per minute\nG2 Esports\nG2 Esports\nK'Sante\nAmbessa\nRenekton\nCS per minute\nXin Zhao\nSkarner\nMaokai\nCS per minute\nAzir\nAhri\nViktor\nCS per minute\nAshe\nCaitlyn\nEzreal\nCS per minute\nSeraphine\nBard\nRakan\nCS per minute\nFnatic\nred side\nblue side\nG2 Esports\nG2 Esports\n\n### Draft [...] ### Draft\n\nFnatic\nKennen\nVi\nTaliyah\nXayah\nAlistar\nRyze\nNeeko\nVarus\nZoe\nLeBlanc\nG2 Esports\nG2 Esports\nRenekton\nMaokai\nViktor\nEzreal\nRakan\nKarma\nJarvan IV\nRumble\nNautilus\nGnar\nFnatic\nRyze\nNeeko\nVarus\nXayah\nVi\nTaliyah\nZoe\nLeBlanc\nKennen\nAlistar\nG2 Esports\nG2 Esports\nKarma\nJarvan IV\nRumble\nRakan\nEzreal\nRenekton\nNautilus\nGnar\nMaokai\nViktor\n\n### Team Stats\n\nFnatic\n\nG2 Esports\nG2 Esports\n\n### Player Performance [...] ### Draft\n\nFnatic\nJax\nZaahen\nOrianna\nCorki\nNami\nVarus\nJarvan IV\nNautilus\nDr."], "news_summary": "SK Gaming and Fnatic are set to face off in a BO3 LEC Regular Season match. SK Gaming has demonstrated strong early-game execution and individual player performance, evidenced by their dominant 28:12 victory over Fnatic in Week 1 with standout performances from top laner Wunder (10/1/5) and mid laner LIDER (6/0/12). Fnatic has shown mixed results in the 2026 season with a 2-2 record through Week 4, including a previous loss to SK, while SK had started 0-1 in the same week but secured first blood and superior objective control in their head-to-head matchup.", "side_yes_case": ["SK Gaming defeated Fnatic decisively in Week 1 with a 28:12 stomp, showcasing strong coordination and win conditions", "SK's top and mid lane (Wunder and LIDER) demonstrated exceptional individual skill with combined 16/0/17 KDA in their previous meeting", "SK secured First Blood in 100% of tracked games and controlled map tempo through superior tower/dragon takedowns", "Fnatic's inconsistent form with 2-2 record and recent losses to top teams (G2, TH, KC) suggests vulnerability", "SK's earlier win included dominant damage distribution and resource control (1241 DPM from Wunder alone)"], "side_no_case": ["Fnatic secured wins against VIT and GIANTX, demonstrating capability to beat quality opponents when prepared", "Fnatic showed improvement trajectory with KCB victory after string of losses, indicating potential adjustment", "BO3 format allows teams to adapt strategy across games; Fnatic can counter-pick and adjust after Game 1 loss", "Fnatic's ADC Upset performed competitively (4/2/3, highest DPM on team) despite overall loss in Week 1", "SK's 0-1 start and subsequent mixed results suggest inconsistency that Fnatic could exploit with proper preparation"], "key_context": ["This is a BO3 match format, allowing for strategic adaptation between games unlike the Week 1 BO1 that SK won", "SK Gaming has head-to-head advantage with proven Week 1 victory, but Fnatic seeking revenge/redemption", "LEC 2026 Versus Season ongoing; both teams still competing for playoff positioning with multiple weeks remaining", "Patch version context unclear from results, but champion pool and meta shifts could affect team preparedness", "SK's dominant individual performances (Wunder, LIDER) may face targeted bans/focus from Fnatic in BO3 preparation"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-13T10:10:25.025172Z"