om the resolution source, this market will resolve based on the underlying real-world match rather than exact name matching. Recognizable abbreviations, alternate or erroneous spellings, sponsor tags, affiliate or academy designations, regional identifiers, and minor formatting differences will be treated as referring to the same team, provided the intended team can be clearly and uniquely identified within the relevant competition. If a listed team name has no reasonable connection to any participating team, or if it matches or could reasonably refer to another team in the same competition such that the intended team cannot be unambiguously determined, this market will resolve 50-50.", "end_date": "2026-04-13T21:30:00Z", "event_start_time": "2026-04-13T15:30:00Z", "yes_price": 0.865, "volume_usd": 26041.946038999977, "category": "counter-strike", "clob_token_ids": ["58121906604898267723097190773953391410179025276068423474186648381180324583491", "93539996814143119188575630316099583408794415126979805120537160295221449818487"]}, "key_facts": ["If team dont win nothing, theyre not tier1?", "Bro, so CCT tournaments who won it, tier1 teams?", "Bro ur brain so small, now era vitality, they winning", "FUT came out on top in their sixth clash with Astralis this year.", "After a grueling month of tier-two LANs, the ranking used for invites to the IEM Cologne Major is now set in stone.", "hope fut wins, this team has so much potential, winning a trophy might keep them together, hopefully no other org buys some of their players,", "Eyeballers, JW Gives Birth On Stage And The Child Is Carried By Donk And Zywoo.", "No Other Then Jame Will Be The Messiah And His Children To Suffer The Sin Of", "karrigan's stint with FaZe is coming to a close after the team's disastrous IEM Cologne qualifying campaign.", "FUT are through to the grand final of PGL Bucharest 2026 following a 2-0 victory over The MongolZ, stealing their opponents' map pick thanks to a great"], "news_summary": "Spirit vs Liquid is scheduled for IEM Rio 2026 Group A on April 13, 2026. Spirit holds a recent 1-0 record against Liquid in the past 30 days and is the bookmaker favorite. Map statistics show Spirit has strong win rates on Overpass (67%) and Anubis (75%), while Liquid struggles on these maps. Liquid's recent form and win rates across the map pool appear weaker compared to Spirit's demonstrated performance.", "side_yes_case": ["Spirit won their last matchup against Liquid (1-0 in past 30 days)", "Spirit is bookmaker favorite with best odds", "Spirit has superior map statistics: 67% on Overpass, 75% on Anubis, 50% on Ancient", "Spirit ranked higher (#9) in team rankings", "Spirit demonstrates better current form ranking"], "side_no_case": ["Liquid win rate on Overpass only 33% (Spirit 67%)", "Liquid win rate on Anubis only 33% (Spirit 75%)", "Liquid appears to have weaker recent form trajectory", "Limited evidence of Liquid strengths in available data", "Liquid has not demonstrated competitive map pool performance"], "key_context": ["IEM Rio 2026 is a $1,000,000 LAN event with 16 teams competing", "Match is Group A stage format on April 13, 2026 at 17:30", "Best-of-3 format determines advancement", "Map pool includes Overpass, Ancient, and Anubis", "Spirit-Liquid head-to-head recent record favors Spirit (1-0 past 30 days)"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-13T10:12:05.912559Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "58121906604898267723097190773953391410179025276068423474186648381180324583491", "data_points": 156, "weighted_avg": 0.8579726164482016, "change_1w_pp": 2.0000000000000018, "change_24h_pp": 2.0000000000000018, "volatility_24h": 0.3888261446340619, "direction": "STABLE", "sharp_moves": []}, "no": {"token_id": "93539996814143119188575630316099583408794415126979805120537160295221449818487", "data_points": 44, "weighted_avg": 0.1425040526620888, "change_1w_pp": -1.9999999999999991, "change_24h_pp": -1.9999999999999991, "volatility_24h": 0.0, "direction": "STABLE", "sharp