# Pictures of isak\n\n## Team stats for isak", "Carlos 'venomzera' Eduardo \u00b7 venomzera \u00b7 Most kills.", "19 ; Filip 'Graviti' Brankovic \u00b7 Graviti \u00b7 Most damage.", "82.2 ; Bryan 'Maka' Canda \u00b7 Maka \u00b7 Most assists.", "### Detailed Results\n\n[edit]\n\n#### Round 1\n\n[edit]\n\nRound 1 Matches\n\nShow\n\nHide\n\nApril 6, 2026\n\nNIC\n\n2\n\n0\n\nZ7\n\nApril 6, 2026 - 11:30 CEST\n\nNIC\")\n\n2:0(Bo3)\n\nZ7\")\n\n13\n\n76\n\nOverpass\n\n9\n\n54\n\n13\n\n58\n\nMirage\n\n11\n\n74\n\n~~Inferno~~\n\nWingman\n\n2\n\n0\n\nWave\n\nApril 6, 2026 - 14:30 CEST\n\nWingman\")\n\n2:0(Bo3)\n\nWave\")\n\n13\n\n103\n\nNuke\n\n8\n\n26\n\n13\n\n67\n\nAncient\n\n6\n\n60\n\n~~Dust II~~\n\nHermine\n\n2\n\n1\n\nP2N\n\nApril 6, 2026 - 17:30 CEST\n\nHermine\")\n\n2:1(Bo3)\n\nP2N\")\n\n19\n\n752131\n\nInferno\n\n16\n\n571201\n\n4\n\n31\n\nMirage\n\n13\n\n94\n\n13\n\n103\n\nAnubis\n\n2\n\n20\n\n3DMAX.A\n\nW\n\nFF\n\neteprem\n\nApril 6, 2026 - 20:30 CEST\n\n3DMAX.A\")\n\nW:FF(Bo3)\n\neteprem\")\n\neternal premium\") forfeit the match due to a schedule conflict with another event."], "news_summary": "Eternal Fire Academy and NeverPlay are scheduled to face off in a Best-of-3 match during the Exort Series #25 Contenders Stage, an online European CS2 tournament running April 6-26, 2026. The Contenders Stage uses a 16-team Swiss system format with the top 8 teams advancing to the Main Stage. Eternal Fire is ranked #68 in the Valve Global Rankings with a competitive EU roster, while NeverPlay is a Portuguese team that recently lost 0-2 to INFUR in Round 1 of this same tournament. Limited direct information is available about their head-to-head matchup.", "side_yes_case": ["Eternal Fire ranked #68 in Valve Global Rankings, indicating higher competitive standing than NeverPlay", "NeverPlay already lost decisively (0-2) to INFUR in Round 1, suggesting vulnerability in the Contenders Stage", "Eternal Fire roster features established EU players (rigoN, Woro2k, DemQQ, EMSTAR, jottAAA) with competitive experience", "NeverPlay's loss to INFUR demonstrates difficulty against comparable competition in same tournament"], "side_no_case": ["NeverPlay avoided immediate elimination despite Round 1 loss, indicating continuation in Swiss format bracket", "Limited public performance data available for NeverPlay, making definitive strength assessment difficult", "Eternal Fire Academy status suggests potentially younger/less experienced roster compared to main team", "Swiss format allows lower-ranked teams opportunities against varied opposition; matchup outcome dependent on bracket positioning"], "key_context": ["Exort Series #25 Contenders Stage: 16-team Swiss system (BO3 matches), Top 8 advance to Main Stage", "NeverPlay lost 0-2 to INFUR on April 7, 2026 in same tournament's Round 1", "Match is online format for European teams", "Eternal Fire Academy designation suggests developmental/secondary roster status", "Swiss format bracket positioning and opponent history in tournament affects current matchup context"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-13T10:13:24.587852Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "21560932918180481023981289999848884093755505766429467313140166032332363375345", "data_points": 2, "weighted_avg": 0.621270368894088, "change_1w_pp": -5.500000000000005, "change_24h_pp": -5.500000000000005, "volatility_24h": 0.0, "direction": "FALLING", "sharp_moves": [{"timestamp": "2026-04-13T10:12:45Z", "delta_pp": -5.500000000000005}]}, "no": {"token_id": "53151276850815591559581217112338024846549857811247038992742965773324260360455", "data_points": 3, "weighted_avg": 0.38587687851325403, "change_1w_pp": 5.500000000000005, "change_24h_pp": 5.500000000000005, "volatility_24h": 3.1819805153394665, "direction": "RISING", "sharp_moves": [{"timestamp": "2026-04-13T08:00:59Z", "delta_pp": 5.000000000000004}]}, "fetched_at": "2026-04-13T10:13:25.273835Z"}}}, "resolution": {"resolved_at": "2026-04-13T21:30:00Z", "winning_side": null, "final_yes_price": 0.5, "ch