ely (~72% NO holds). Confidence in NO is only 45% because briefing provides no team-level tactical data, coaching changes, or head-to-head matchup history; confidence in YES slightly higher (62%) because WIP's undefeated status and round differential are measurable, though limited in scope.", "key_factor": "Mandatory executes a deliberate anti-WIP tactical meta shift (agent pool, site executes, economy discipline) that WIP has not prepared for, exploiting WIP's overconfidence and limited scrim prep against this specific opponent in a must-win playoff-race scenario.", "probability_yes": 0.28, "probability_no": 0.72, "probability_source": "synthetic_mirror"}], "final_score": 0.5154285714285715, "no_score": 0.47199017199017196, "edge": 0.2904285714285715, "no_edge": -0.30300982800982806, "recommendation": "PASS", "confidence_level": "MEDIUM", "signal_type": null, "pass_reason": "Contrarian call: council prob 52% < 70% threshold; Contrarian call: YES-side confidence 60% < 80% threshold", "expected_roi": 0.0, "briefing": {"market": {"id": "1960163", "question": "Valorant: WIP Esports vs Mandatory (BO3) - VCL France: Revolution Stage 2 Regular Season", "resolution_criteria": "This market refers to the Valorant match between WIP Esports and Mandatory in the VCL France: Revolution Stage 2 Regular Season, initially scheduled for April 13 at 12:00PM ET.\n\nThis market will resolve to \"WIP Esports\" if WIP Esports win the match against Mandatory.\n\nThis market will resolve to \"Mandatory\" if Mandatory win the match against WIP Esports.\n\nIf the match is canceled (not played at all), ends in a tie, or is delayed beyond 7 days from the scheduled date without a winner determined, this market will resolve to 50-50. \n\nIf the match begins but is not completed, and one team wins due to the opponent's forfeiture, disqualification, or walkover, this market will resolve to the team who wins. \n\nIf the match ends in a forfeit, disqualification, or walkover (team withdraws before the start and the other wins automatically), this market will resolve to 50-50. \n\nThe resolution source for this market will be official information from https://vlr.gg. However, if https://vlr.gg has not published final results within 2 hours after the event\u2019s conclusion, a consensus of credible reporting may be used instead including video evidence.\n\nIn cases where a team\u2019s listed name includes minor discrepancies from the resolution source, this market will resolve based on the underlying real-world match rather than exact name matching. Recognizable abbreviations, alternate or erroneous spellings, sponsor tags, affiliate or academy designations, regional identifiers, and minor formatting differences will be treated as referring to the same team, provided the intended team can be clearly and uniquely identified within the relevant competition. If a listed team name has no reasonable connection to any participating team, or if it matches or could reasonably refer to another team in the same competition such that the intended team cannot be unambiguously determined, this market will resolve 50-50.", "end_date": "2026-04-13T22:00:00Z", "event_start_time": "2026-04-13T16:00:00Z", "yes_price": 0.225, "volume_usd": 3542.00038, "category": "valorant", "clob_token_ids": ["79720653084492924093002587346392543562573583154000840152650396731915516959625", "85921010026849250616845778279286856674699903574117753032854252425357516361584"]}, "key_facts": ["Top Valorant esports teams rankings list and tiers in Europe.", "R, ACS, K, D, A, +/\u2013, KAST, ADR, HS%, FK, FD, +/\u2013", "Stats, score, streams, and VODs from WIP Esports vs.", "Mandatory - Week 2 match of Challengers 2026: France Revolution Stage 2 Valorant event.", "Nuxeria Esport - Week 1 match of Challengers 2026: France Revolution Stage 2 Valorant event.", "## Format\n\n## Results\n\n### Standings\n\n| Standings Week 1  Week 1 | | | | | | |\n ---  ---  --- \n| 1.", "| WIP EsportsWIP Esports WIP Esports | 3-0 | 6-2 | 99-69 | +30 |\n| 2.", "| F9 EICARF9 EICAR F9 EICAR | 3-1 | 6-4 | 113-100 | +13 |\n| 3.", "| Mandatory Mandatory | 2-1 | 5-2 | 75-55 | +20 |\n| 4.", "| Caldya EsportCaldya Esport Caldya Esport\") | 2-2 | 6-6 | 120-117 | +3 |\n| 5."], "news_summary": "WIP Esports and Mandatory are competing in VALORANT Challengers 2026 France: Revolution Stage 2 Group Stage. WIP Esports currently leads the standings with a 3-0 record, 6-2 map count, and +30 round differential. Mandatory sits in 2nd place with a 2-1 record, 5-2 map count, and +20 round differential. This matchup will significantly impact playoff positioning in the regular season.", "side_yes_case": ["WIP Esports undefeated with 3-0 record and +30 round differential, demonstrating dominant form", "WIP Esports leads group standings with superior map win rate (6-2 vs 5-2)", "WIP Esports has established track record of winning against top competition in group", "Mandatory in 2nd place shows competitive but slightly weaker performance trajectory"], "side_no_case": ["Mandatory maintains strong +20 round differential, indicating close competitive level", "Mandatory's 2-1 record shows ability to win against group opponents", "Close map differential (5-2 vs 6-2) suggests matches are competitive and not decisive blowouts", "Both teams have limited head-to-head context available in search results"], "key_context": ["Best-of-3 (BO3) format match - requires winning 2 maps out of 3", "VCL France Revolution Stage 2 Group Stage regular season match", "Playoff positioning implications based on final group standings", "VALORANT Challengers 2026 tournament - France regional competition", "8-team group stage format with potential advancement criteria unknown"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-13T10:14:23.749540Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "79720653084492924093002587346392543562573583154000840152650396731915516959625", "data_points": 6, "weighted_avg": 0.21640245494233462, "change_1w_pp": 4.000000000000001, "change_24h_