m, provided the intended team can be clearly and uniquely identified within the relevant competition. If a listed team name has no reasonable connection to any participating team, or if it matches or could reasonably refer to another team in the same competition such that the intended team cannot be unambiguously determined, this market will resolve 50-50.", "end_date": "2026-04-14T17:00:00Z", "event_start_time": "2026-04-14T11:00:00Z", "yes_price": 0.435, "volume_usd": 5458.498504000001, "category": "valorant", "clob_token_ids": ["71521698410155028282731311947784719125172556460696888417345046038329019505078", "61916265896196448694520891755319390641142815546427906245941213581585132622801"]}, "key_facts": ["In the second week of VCT China 2026 Stage 1, five teams across two different groups qualified for the playoffs, with EDG, XLG, and TYLOO remaining as the", "Stats, score, streams, and VODs from TBD vs.", "TBD - Seeding match of VCT 2026: China Stage 1 Valorant event.", "Riot has announced the details of its new partnership format that will begin next season, which features a tournament-centric model that also looks to", "Netherlands Milan, Milan de Meij, Head Coach, 2025-02-18.", "Denmark Desmo, Casper Rasmussen, Assistant Coach, 2025-12-01.", "That is not our fault regardless; we are pulling the scores from GRID, and let's just say there's a glitch within the GRID system that made both delb and", "April.10th Qualification/Elimination Situation: If TE wins 1 map against NOVA, DRG will qualify for Stage 1 Playoffs.", "picks up a team of promising rookies but 1 is too young to play kickoff.", "instantly over achieves and makes masters."], "news_summary": "The search results contain limited specific information about Trace Esports vs Dragon Ranger Gaming. The results reference VCT China 2026 Stage 1 Group Omega seeding matches and qualification scenarios, indicating this is a competitive playoff positioning match. One result mentions that if Trace Esports wins even 