th are Challengers-tier competitors fighting for 4-win advancement. Absence of recent SaD Esports match data in briefing is conspicuous: if SaD were in strong form or roster-stable heading into this match, at least one recent result would likely appear; silence suggests team disruption or dormancy. Nightblood's player-level stats show consistency across multiple matches (three-column format indicates recent games, not historical averages); SaD's lack of equivalent current stats is a critical data asymmetry favoring the underdog Nightblood side. Market consensus (44% YES / 55% NO) reflects the historical rating gap but likely ignores roster/meta mismatch and data freshness differential; contrarian edge exists if SaD roster has changed or if they are unfamiliar with current 2026 Challengers meta.", "key_factor": "Nightblood Gaming's 2-2 record masks a recent win-streak or tactical innovation that thrives in BO3 formats, while SaD Esports' higher historical ratings are stale (last recorded July 2025) and do not reflect current roster/meta alignment for 2026 Challengers competition.", "probability_yes": 0.38, "probability_no": 0.62, "probability_source": "synthetic_mirror"}], "final_score": 0.4340579710144928, "no_score": 0.5668810289389068, "edge": -0.010942028985507224, "no_edge": 0.011881028938906857, "recommendation": "PASS", "confidence_level": "MEDIUM", "signal_type": null, "pass_reason": "Council prob too low: 57% for NO (need \u226557%); NO-side confidence too low: 44% (need \u226567%)", "expected_roi": 0.0, "briefing": {"market": {"id": "1918558", "question": "Valorant: Nightblood Gaming vs SaD Esports (BO3) - VCL North America: Stage 2 Group Stage", "resolution_criteria": "This market refers to the Valorant Round 5 match between Nightblood Gaming and SaD Esports in the VCL North America: Stage 2 Group Stage, initially scheduled for April 14 at 4:00PM ET.\n\nThis market will resolve to \"Nightblood Gaming\" if Nightblood Gaming win the match against SaD Esports