ized map pools or tactical schemes tailored to exploit specific opponents. NODWIN Clutch Series appears to be secondary/regional tier (not IEM, BLAST, or PGL majors), meaning tier-2 teams can have significant upset potential due to less standardized preparation and scouting. Market has moved +4.5pp toward YES in 24h after a sharp -14pp NO drop on Apr 14 06:00 UTC. This suggests reactive repricing to news (possibly roster change confirmation or odds adjustment), not fundamental analytical strength. BO3 format with lower-bracket elimination stakes (loser out) creates psychological pressure. TDK with a freshly disrupted roster may struggle under high-pressure mapping/veto phases against a team that has had time to prepare. Briefing explicitly states 'LIMITED specific information about TDK vs MANA eSports'\u2014this symmetrical information vacuum argues against 68% confidence in either direction. Only concrete competitive signal: TDK loss of established player (zorte) to better-known organization (BetBoom). This suggests team instability or recruitment failure, not strength.", "key_factor": "TDK roster destabilization from recent zorte departure to BetBoom compounds with MANA eSports executing a prepared tactical meta shift or map pool exploit that counters TDK's current lineup composition.", "probability_yes": 0.62, "probability_no": 0.38, "probability_source": "synthetic_mirror"}], "final_score": 0.5654914947197899, "no_score": 0.44134679183163483, "edge": 0.014999999999999902, "no_edge": 0.385, "recommendation": "PASS", "confidence_level": "LOW", "signal_type": null, "pass_reason": "Council prob too low: 57% for YES (need \u226557%); YES-side confidence too low: 34% (need \u226567%)", "expected_roi": 0.0, "perceived_win_rate_at_run": 0.7, "kelly_stake_full": 0.0, "kelly_stake_scaled": 0.0, "kelly_multiplier": 0.0, "agent_weights_snapshot": {"The Rules Lawyer": 1.0632193053977828, "The Bull": 0.9488231424655758, "The Base-Rate Statistician": 1.0510237036825305, "The S