 has no reasonable connection to any participating team, or if it matches or could reasonably refer to another team in the same competition such that the intended team cannot be unambiguously determined, this market will resolve 50-50.", "end_date": "2026-04-15T23:00:00Z", "event_start_time": "2026-04-15T17:00:00Z", "yes_price": 0.685, "volume_usd": 223.593512, "category": "counter-strike", "clob_token_ids": ["90507613029070642347923309323867337352327567580831885942646146157618737878648", "11864354101457637509623993994271761487353089289483433250950473225829136460260"], "sports_market_type": "moneyline"}, "key_facts": ["It works like hltv, there comes a point where vitality has max points, so they dont gain more but everyone else looses compared to vitality.", "The biggest and most comprehensive database of Counter-Strike statistics in the world!", "Press play on the media player to find out.", "Get the complete overview of GenOne's current lineup, upcoming matches, recent results and much more.", "Best of 3 (LAN) * Group B lower bracket final.", "Winner advances to quarter-finals, losing team is eliminated.", "Team ranking for Denmark on April 13th, 2026.", "HLTV.org\nHLTV.org\nHLTV.org\n\nHLTV.org\n\nAurora\n\u00d6zg\u00fcr 'woxic' Eker\n\n# AWP kills / round\n\n# RANKING\n\nVitality\nVitality\nNatus Vincere\nFURIA\nPARIVISION\nFalcons\n\n# EVENTS\n\nIEM Rio 2026\nIEM Rio 2026\nBLAST Rivals 2026 Season 1\nPGL Astana 2026\nIEM Atlanta 2026\nIEM Atlanta 2026\n CS Asia Championships 2026\n CS Asia Championships 2026\n\n# FPL RANKING\n\nMustafa 'Shooter' Kamal\nrecar\nBelal 'AbbyDog' Embaby\nWyatt 'Weeza' Sahrmann\nWyatt 'snav' Phillippi\n\n# GALLERIES\n\n# RECENT ACTIVITY\n\n# MINIGAME\n\n# TOP 30 TRANSFERS [...] # RECENT ACTIVITY\n\n# MINIGAME\n\n# TOP 30 TRANSFERS\n\nMartin 'stavn' Lund\nNo team\nNinjas in Pyjamas\nNinjas in Pyjamas\nArtem 'r1nkle' Moroz\nNinjas in Pyjamas\nNinjas in Pyjamas\nNinjas in Pyjamas\nNinjas in Pyjamas\nAleksandr 'zorte' Zagodyrenko\nTDK\n