le match outcome; standings don't guarantee head-to-head result", "Search results provide limited specific CL match history between these two teams"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-15T17:49:19.119912Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "35613843576585728475052139353127855419846230621169769985708564247860143237220", "data_points": 94, "weighted_avg": 0.7025440967596824, "change_1w_pp": 22.499999999999996, "change_24h_pp": 1.5000000000000013, "volatility_24h": 1.2002603884157774, "direction": "RISING", "sharp_moves": [{"timestamp": "2026-04-11T01:00:48Z", "delta_pp": 26.5}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-11T17:00:52Z", "delta_pp": -27.500000000000004}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-11T23:00:52Z", "delta_pp": 26.0}]}, "no": {"token_id": "102431159405558195564259079811403386059994438254414626686020573469177054341003", "data_points": 114, "weighted_avg": 0.29954582812048725, "change_1w_pp": -22.499999999999996, "change_24h_pp": -1.4999999999999958, "volatility_24h": 1.067153123723904, "direction": "FALLING", "sharp_moves": [{"timestamp": "2026-04-11T01:00:45Z", "delta_pp": -26.5}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-11T17:00:46Z", "delta_pp": 27.500000000000004}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-11T22:00:58Z", "delta_pp": -23.0}]}, "fetched_at": "2026-04-15T17:49:19.517446Z"}}}, "resolution": {"resolved_at": "2026-04-16T11:00:00Z", "winning_side": "NO", "final_yes_price": 0.0, "checked_at": "2026-04-16T14:49:53.829709+00:00", "source": "gamma_api"}, "analysis": null}
