anized by EPL. The search results confirm the match is scheduled for tomorrow at 08:00 PM but provide minimal specific information about either team's current form, roster composition, or head-to-head history. No detailed team statistics, recent match results, or performance data were found in the available sources.", "side_yes_case": ["Limited negative information available about either team's recent performance", "EPL Season 36 is an ongoing tournament providing both teams with current competitive experience", "Match scheduling suggests both teams qualified for group stage participation"], "side_no_case": ["Insufficient data on either team's recent form, win rates, or head-to-head record", "No team composition, player statistics, or roster information available", "Cannot assess relative team strength without comparative performance metrics"], "key_context": ["EPL Season 36 is a Tier 3 online European Dota 2 tournament running April 2-17, 2026", "Match is scheduled for group stage play at 08:00 PM", "No head-to-head history or previous match results between WinteR SquadronS and Ivory located", "Best of 3 format reduces variance compared to single-game matches", "Lack of accessible recent form data for both teams limits predictive confidence"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-15T21:54:00.167825Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "88316692964581176302654695179140682100759339266213481176390804687102334734574", "data_points": 9, "weighted_avg": 0.43003799299496565, "change_1w_pp": -17.5, "change_24h_pp": -6.5, "volatility_24h": 13.567424221273543, "direction": "FALLING", "sharp_moves": [{"timestamp": "2026-04-15T01:00:52Z", "delta_pp": -10.999999999999998}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T11:00:57Z", "delta_pp": 18.0}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T21:54:00Z", "delta_pp": -20.0}]}, "no": {"token_id": "6477811238520484357101672043410145711077404701417568388235289685885103200400", "data_points": 41, "weighted_avg": 0.5768345350606809, "change_1w_pp": 19.999999999999996, "change_2