ifiers, and minor formatting differences will be treated as referring to the same team, provided the intended team can be clearly and uniquely identified within the relevant competition. If a listed team name has no reasonable connection to any participating team, or if it matches or could reasonably refer to another team in the same competition such that the intended team cannot be unambiguously determined, this market will resolve 50-50.", "end_date": "2026-04-16T15:00:00Z", "event_start_time": "2026-04-16T09:00:00Z", "yes_price": 0.425, "volume_usd": 2248.1934340000003, "category": "valorant", "clob_token_ids": ["92801388897846732398107837012521480410452454718877401567708610478140534849859", "85025891781328691197966783562308648818233458833811673062264377990146601807468"], "sports_market_type": "moneyline"}, "key_facts": ["Top Valorant esports teams rankings list and tiers in Europe.", "Mobile Legends Professional League Philippines (also known as MPL Philippines or MPL PH) is a professional league in the Philippines.", "China Gazero, Li Zhe, Manager, 2024-01-17.", "Taiwan AfteR, Lo Wen-hsin, Head Coach, 2025-01-03.", "MPL Philippines Season 17 is an offline Filipino ML tournament organized by Moonton and Mineski Global.", "This A-Tier tournament takes place from Mar 20 to", "So I have been seeing some threads about how Zekken left on his own, and it wasn't kaps fault, which is just not true at all.", "Taylor Swift is quite literally the peak of music evolution, and anyone who disagrees is just not operating on the same intellectual frequency.", "Stats, score, streams, and VODs from LEO Esports vs.", "Natus Vincere Junior - Round 5 match of Challengers 2026: NORTH//EAST Stage 2 Valorant event."], "news_summary": "Nova Esports and Wolves Esports are competing in VCT China 2026 Stage 1 Group Omega. Both teams are ranked similarly (#19 and #18 in China respectively) and have struggled early in the tournament. Wolves initially lost to EDG 0-2 but rebounded to extend their lead at the top of Group Omega by week two. Nova suffered an early 0-2 loss to Dragon Ranger Gaming but showed improvement with a win in week two. The match represents a direct competition between two mid-tier teams in the same group.", "side_yes_case": ["Wolves ranked #18 in China, one position above Nova's #19 ranking", "Wolves extended their lead at the top of Group Omega by week two with multiple wins", "Wolves showed resilience after initial 0-2 loss to EDG, demonstrating adaptability", "Nova struggles with consistency, including shutout 0-2 loss to Dragon Ranger Gaming"], "side_no_case": ["Nova demonstrated improvement and rebound capability with week two performance gains", "Both teams are closely ranked and appear relatively evenly matched in strength", "Nova had individual standout performances from players like GuanG in recent matches", "Wolves' early losses suggest vulnerability that Nova could exploit"], "key_context": ["Both teams competing in Group Omega alongside EDG, XLG, Trace, and Dragon Ranger Gaming", "VCT China 2026 Stage 1 uses a round-robin group stage format with BO3 matches", "Recent results show high variance: EDG and XLG identified as two strongest Group Omega teams", "Search results span week 1-2 of tournament; current week/match timing unclear from data provided", "Both teams winless or struggling through early stage, making form trajectory uncertain"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-15T21:56:12.394382Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "92801388897846732398107837012521480410452454718877401567708610478140534849859", "data_points": 7, "weighted_avg": 0.4351102418226597, "change_1w_pp": -2.500000000000002, "change_24h_pp": 0.0, "volatility_24h": 0.0, "direction": "STABLE", "sharp_moves": []}, "no": {"token_id": "85025891781328691197966783562308648818233458833811673062264377990146601807468", "data_points": 53, "weighted_avg": 0.5643195322026885, "change_1w_pp": 7.499999999999996, "change_24h_pp": 0.5000000000000004, "volatility_24h":