ate or erroneous spellings, sponsor tags, affiliate or academy designations, regional identifiers, and minor formatting differences will be treated as referring to the same team, provided the intended team can be clearly and uniquely identified within the relevant competition. If a listed team name has no reasonable connection to any participating team, or if it matches or could reasonably refer to another team in the same competition such that the intended team cannot be unambiguously determined, this market will resolve 50-50.", "end_date": "2026-04-16T07:00:00Z", "event_start_time": "2026-04-16T01:00:00Z", "yes_price": 0.2, "volume_usd": 156.48276199999998, "category": "valorant", "clob_token_ids": ["86236354617724269998360643515995220447730496141483206325311055298528599168122", "21724679339362905221006313714116326466514800872787175869469718040597950062447"], "sports_market_type": "moneyline"}, "key_facts": ["Contra | Challengers 2026: LATAM North ACE Stage 1 | Round Robin | Valorant match | VLR.gg\nno politics/religion Pickems: VCT 26 EMEA Kickoff Pickems: VCT 26 PAC Kickoff Pickems: VCT 26 AMER Kickoff Pickems: VCL NA Stage 1 Swiss.", "1 INTERNET EXPLORER BUT [FURIA surpasses MIBR 3-2 to earn first-ever Masters qualification.", "T1 \u2013 VCT 2026: Pacific Kickoff MBF The truth about MiBR.", "AB3 ban Breeze; BBB ban Split; AB3 pick Bind; BBB pick Abyss; AB3 ban Pearl; BBB ban Haven; Corrode remains.", "1.25  BBB  odds pre-match Sign up for Rainbet for Valorant Bets!", "| paganus  BBB |  | 1.33 1.14 1.89 | 336 301 444 | 19 13 6 | /  12 9 3  / | 3 3 0 | +7 +4 +3 | 81% 92% 50% | 182 156 259 | 14% 12% 24% | 5 4 1 | 1 1 0 | +4 +3 +1 |.", "| dedmos  BBB |  | 1.23 1.36 0.84 | 185 202 136 | 11 9 2 | /  6 3 3  / | 8 6 2 | +5 +6 -1 | 81% 83% 75% | 120 134 75 | 29% 29% 33% | 1 0 1 | 0 0 0 | +1 0 +1 |.", "| Peloncito  BBB |  | 1.09 1.24 0.64 | 199 238 84 | 13 11 2 | /  8 6 2  / | 3 3 0 | +5 +5 0 | 75% 75% 75% | 130 160 40 | 41% 45% 20% | 1 1 0 | 1 1 0 | 0 0 0 |.", "| paganus  BBB |  | 1.39 1.22 1.31 | 304 349 247 | 39 24 15 | /  23 14 9  / | 6 5 1 | +16 +10 +6 | 80% 84% 75% | 169 193 141 | 17% 15% 22% | 10 6 4 | 3 3 0 | +7 +3 +4 |.", "| paganus  BBB |  | 1.30 1.82 1.00 | 272 430 181 | 20 11 9 | /  11 5 6  / | 3 2 1 | +9 +6 +3 | 79% 71% 83% | 159 257 102 | 24% 27% 20% | 5 2 3 | 2 2 0 | +3 0 +3 |."], "news_summary": "AB3 Esports and Contra are set to compete in a BO3 match within the VCL Latin America North ACE Masters Group B tournament. According to circuit standings from Stage 1, Contra has earned 80 points and currently ranks 2nd, while AB3 Esports has 0 points and ranks 7th, indicating a significant competitive gap. The match involves standard Valorant map selection with bans and picks determining the final map pool. Betting odds show Contra as the favored team in this matchup.", "side_yes_case": ["Contra ranks 2nd in circuit standings with 80 points from Stage 1, demonstrating consistent strong performance", "Pre-match betting odds favor Contra at 1.25, indicating professional consensus on their superiority", "AB3 Esports has 0 circuit points, suggesting they have not yet achieved tournament success in this circuit", "Contra's higher ranking provides confidence in their ability to win the BO3 format"], "side_no_case": ["AB3 Esports is competing in a BO3 format where single map wins create comeback opportunities", "Early tournament stage suggests teams may still be developing form and synergy", "AB3 Esports' 0 points could indicate recent roster changes or adjustments rather than fundamental weakness", "Map selection and bans (AB3 bans Breeze, Pearl; Contra bans Split, Haven) may create favorable conditions for AB3"], "key_context": ["This is an ACE Masters Group B match in the VCL Latin America North circuit following Stage 1", "BO3 format requires winning 2 out of 3 maps, creating multiple swing points", "Tournament is part of a larger circuit with Stage 1 and Stage 2 competition ahead", "Contra currently positioned for advancem