: RRQ Jemkin - 1.17 (china no r2.0 - v0okashu 231 ACS)  \nMasters Madrid: PRX something - 1.06  \nKickoff: GX Cloud - 1.21 (china no r2.0 - v0okashu 248 ACS)\n\n2023  \nChampions: GIA Cloud - 1.15  \nLCQ: 4AM sphiry - 1.20  \nMasters Tokyo: FNC Chronicle - 1.19  \nLeague: PRX something - 1.21  \nLOCK//IN: MKOI trexx - 1.39\n\nflex players tend to have lower r2.0 ratings\n\ni forgot no sea players went to bangkok so when i inputted it i forgot to skip it lol\n\noh oops\n\nid put bind in A\n\ni like this series and ik yall dont gaf but im doing it for every region idc\n\n2026:  \nKickoff: FS primmie - 1.23 [...] 2026:  \nKickoff: FS primmie - 1.23\n\n2025  \nChampions: PRX Jinggg - 1.05  \nStage 2: PRX Jinggg - 1.14  \nMasters Toronto: PRX f0rsakeN - 1.12  \nStage 1: TS invy - 1.26  \nMasters Bangkok:  \nKickoff: TLN primmie - 1.19\n\n2024  \nChampions: TLN primmie - 1.22  \nStage 2: PRX d4v41 - 1.18  \nMasters Shanghai: PRX Jinggg - 217.5 ACS  \nStage 1: PRX d4v41 - 1.13  \nMasters Madrid: PRX f0rsakeN - 1.04  \nKickoff: TLN JitBoyS - 1.20\n\n2023  \nChampions: PRX d4v41 - 1.08  \nLCQ: GE Monyet - 1.34  \nMasters Tokyo: PRX Jinggg & d4v41 - 1.08  \nLeague: PRX d4v41 - 1.18  \nLOCK//IN: RRQ Emman - 1.19\n\ni creamed\n\nohhh\n\nwhats the point [...] |  |  |\n --- |\n| Flag: | South Korea |\n| Registered: | November 30, 2025 |\n| Last post: | April 15, 2026 at 10:39 AM |\n| Posts: | 2237 |\n\ni mean she could put both\n\nbut then it wouldnt be #aesthetic\n\nand that woild ruin the #vibe\n\nrahhh idk why it posted twice\n\non a good note doesnt that mean one of them is knocked out\n\nidk i dont watch football\n\nbeing the best female team itw for 2 years still has more aura than being the winner of a stage of tier 2 in one region\n\nwait which ones thats so cool :3\n\ntbf she prolly wouldnt either way cuz GC Champion Winner x2 sounds better even thought the calibre of teams is worse than t2\n\nheh..", "what did he change it to\n\nu dont know UST sonofcar?", "wtf\n\nmee o