s)", "Winter 2026 Semifinals \u2014 Spandau won 1-0 against BIG in Game 1, but lost subsequent matches (Games 3-4 recorded as losses)"], "disambiguation_warnings": ["Past-tense match-result language detected in side_yes_case[0], side_yes_case[1], side_no_case[0] despite this event starts at 2026-04-16 18:00 UTC (in the future). Sample: \"Spandau won 1-0 against both TOG an\". Treat any final scoreline as a PRIOR encounter, not this market's outcome."], "data_freshness": "2026-04-16T14:35:48.405046Z", "price_history": null, "structured_match": null}}, "resolution": {"resolved_at": "2026-04-17T00:00:00Z", "winning_side": "NO", "final_yes_price": 0.0, "checked_at": "2026-04-17T00:44:09.934713+00:00", "source": "gamma_api"}, "analysis": null}
