or if it matches or could reasonably refer to another team in the same competition such that the intended team cannot be unambiguously determined, this market will resolve 50-50.", "end_date": "2026-04-17T01:00:00Z", "event_start_time": "2026-04-16T19:00:00Z", "yes_price": 0.68, "volume_usd": 0.0, "category": "counter-strike", "clob_token_ids": ["84061271664253890027699867124061320726353098296181693833385287696095582097278", "56277353810670330330545084545760148242916750228987755004940822348872714050036"], "sports_market_type": "moneyline"}, "verdicts": [{"agent_name": "The Rules Lawyer", "probability": 0.62, "probability_yes": 0.62, "probability_no": 0.38, "probability_source": "independent", "confidence_yes": 0.28, "confidence_no": 0.25, "rationale": "EVENT TIMING COHERENCE: Event is TODAY, starts in ~4 hours (2026-04-16 19:00 UTC). No match result has been published yet. The prior match fact (eternal premium 2:1 LFO on 2026-03-12) is from a different opponent and dates to 5 weeks ago \u2014 it provides minimal predictive value for today's LFO vs hindsight matchup. MARKET PRICE SIGNAL: YES (LFO) trades at 68%, NO (hindsight) at 32%. This represents a +17.5pp sharp move in the last 24 hours favoring LFO. Market pricing reflects some consensus that LFO is the moderate favorite, but with modest confidence given low volume ($0 traded) and thin information. DATA DEFICIENCY - BOTH SIDES: The briefing contains player profile fragments (fynchojka, hey) with recent match history, but these profiles do not clearly map to LFO or hindsight rosters. No direct team-level statistics, recent head-to-head record, or explicit form comparison is provided. This creates symmetric ignorance on both sides. LFO EVIDENCE (WEAK): One prior match shows LFO lost 1:2 to eternal premium on 2026-03-12 in the same ESEA Advanced Season 56 Europe league. Loss to a presumably stronger opponent does not predict performance vs hindsight. No recent LFO team results or roster status provided. HINDSIGHT 