{"run_id": "31535db8-8be9-4c68-94aa-dbad9ce9e0da", "timestamp": "2026-04-17T00:48:00.154392+00:00", "legacy": false, "result": {"market": {"id": "1935234", "question": "LoL: HANJIN BRION Challengers vs BNK FearX Youth (BO3) - LCK Challengers League Rounds 1-2", "resolution_criteria": "This market refers to the LoL match between HANJIN BRION Challengers and BNK FearX Youth in the LCK Challengers League Rounds 1-2, initially scheduled for April 17 at 1:00AM ET.\n\nThis market will resolve to \"HANJIN BRION Challengers\" if HANJIN BRION Challengers win the match against BNK FearX Youth.\n\nThis market will resolve to \"BNK FearX Youth\" if BNK FearX Youth win the match against HANJIN BRION Challengers.\n\nIf the match is canceled (not played at all), ends in a tie, or is delayed beyond 7 days from the scheduled date without a winner determined, this market will resolve to 50-50. \n\nIf the match begins but is not completed, and one team wins due to the opponent's forfeiture, disqualification, or walkover, this market will resolve to the team who wins. \n\nIf the match ends in a forfeit, disqualification, or walkover (team withdraws before the start and the other wins automatically), this market will resolve to 50-50. \n\nThe resolution source for this market will be official information from https://gol.gg/esports/home. However, if https://gol.gg/esports/home has not published final results within 2 hours after the event\u2019s conclusion, a consensus of credible reporting may be used instead including video evidence.\n\nIn cases where a team\u2019s listed name includes minor discrepancies from the resolution source, this market will resolve based on the underlying real-world match rather than exact name matching. Recognizable abbreviations, alternate or erroneous spellings, sponsor tags, affiliate or academy designations, regional identifiers, and minor formatting differences will be treated as referring to the same team, provided the intended team can be clearly and uniquely identified within the relevant competition. If a listed team name has no reasonable connection to any participating team, or if it matches or could reasonably refer to another team in the same competition such that the intended team cannot be unambiguously determined, this market will resolve 50-50.", "end_date": "2026-04-17T11:00:00Z", "event_start_time": "2026-04-17T05:00:00Z", "yes_price": 0.395, "volume_usd": 20400.763937000003, "category": "league-of-legends", "clob_token_ids": ["5895847871081817217408159969549291146551485179417391443926660275617895247023", "60425774648894603673184317693412509255224012812701098151507908680662083330782"], "sports_market_type": "moneyline"}, "verdicts": [{"agent_name": "The Rules Lawyer", "probability": 0.62, "probability_yes": 0.62, "probability_no": 0.38, "probability_source": "independent", "confidence_yes": 0.72, "confidence_no": 0.55, "rationale": "TEMPORAL COHERENCE: Briefing explicitly warns that past-tense language in side_yes_case refers to Week 1 (2026-04-01), not this event (2026-04-17). BRION's 2-0 head-to-head result is historical context only, not proof of imminent outcome. CONDITION FOR YES RESOLUTION: HANJIN BRION Challengers must win the BO3 match on 2026-04-17. No walkover, forfeit, or cancellation language in briefing suggests elevated risk of 50-50 resolution. BRION FORM ANALYSIS: Mixed recent performance in same tournament. Week 1: 2-0 win vs. FearX Youth (strong). Week 3: 3-0 vs. Gen.G Global Academy (dominant). Week 2: 0-2 losses to DRX and NewSoopBros (severe vulnerability). This volatility suggests inconsistency\u2014BRION can beat mid-tier opponents but struggles vs. stronger teams. FEARX YOUTH FORM ANALYSIS: Limited data in briefing. Week 2 result (2-1 win vs. Gen.G Global Academy) shows competitive ability. No other match results provided. Insufficient data to build strong NO-side confidence. HEAD-TO-HEAD CONTEXT (NOT PREDICTIVE): BRION defeated FearX 2-0 in Week 1, but league play is volatile