{"run_id": "a39914c8-4f1e-4d23-a7e7-6f7884e31211", "timestamp": "2026-04-17T01:11:28.268955+00:00", "legacy": false, "result": {"market": {"id": "1937907", "question": "Rainbow Six Siege: KINOTROPE gaming vs CAG Osaka (BO3) - Asia-Pacific League Kickoff: North Playoffs", "resolution_criteria": "This market refers to the Rainbow Six Siege Upper bracket final match between KINOTROPE gaming and CAG Osaka in the Asia-Pacific League Kickoff: North Playoffs, initially scheduled for April 17 at 3:00AM ET.\n\nThis market will resolve to \"KINOTROPE gaming\" if KINOTROPE gaming win the match against CAG Osaka.\n\nThis market will resolve to \"CAG Osaka\" if CAG Osaka win the match against KINOTROPE gaming.\n\nIf the match is canceled (not played at all), ends in a tie, or is delayed beyond 7 days from the scheduled date without a winner determined, this market will resolve to 50-50. \n\nIf the match begins but is not completed, and one team wins due to the opponent's forfeiture, disqualification, or walkover, this market will resolve to the team who wins. \n\nIf the match ends in a forfeit, disqualification, or walkover (team withdraws before the start and the other wins automatically), this market will resolve to 50-50. \n\nThe resolution source for this market will be official information from https://liquipedia.net/rainbowsix/Main_Page. However, if https://liquipedia.net/rainbowsix/Main_Page has not published final results within 2 hours after the event\u2019s conclusion, a consensus of credible reporting may be used instead including video evidence.\n\nIn cases where a team\u2019s listed name includes minor discrepancies from the resolution source, this market will resolve based on the underlying real-world match rather than exact name matching. Recognizable abbreviations, alternate or erroneous spellings, sponsor tags, affiliate or academy designations, regional identifiers, and minor formatting differences will be treated as referring to the same team, provided the intended team can be clearly and uniquely identified within the relevant competition. If a listed team name has no reasonable connection to any participating team, or if it matches or could reasonably refer to another team in the same competition such that the intended team cannot be unambiguously determined, this market will resolve 50-50.", "end_date": "2026-04-17T13:00:00Z", "event_start_time": "2026-04-17T07:00:00Z", "yes_price": 0.285, "volume_usd": 25.23985, "category": "rainbow-six-siege", "clob_token_ids": ["58888539376532152369746600015300630446539599311503996126991448164768013847484", "102660720253613935236121142109787835167500416299312076595573224212492127402758"], "sports_market_type": "moneyline"}, "verdicts": [{"agent_name": "The Rules Lawyer", "probability": 0.32, "probability_yes": 0.32, "probability_no": 0.68, "probability_source": "independent", "confidence_yes": 0.45, "confidence_no": 0.62, "rationale": "TEMPORAL COHERENCE CONFIRMED: Event timing is TODAY (2026-04-17 07:00 UTC, ~6 hours from data timestamp). All past-tense scorelines in briefing (CAG vs DK 2-0 on April 10; KINOTROPE vs SCARZ 2-1 on April 3) are PRIOR encounters, not this market's outcome. This market's resolution depends on the future match result. CURRENT MARKET PRICES SIGNAL: YES = 28% ($0.28/share), NO = 72% ($0.72/share). Market is heavily favoring CAG Osaka. This reflects informed trading ahead of the match. YES CASE (KINOTROPE gaming): KINOTROPE defeated SCARZ 2-1 on April 3, showing resilience in close BO3 matches. Roster has multiple MVP-caliber players (Kawa, Ayagator, Eclair each earned 1 tournament MVP). Both teams are in Lower Bracket, indicating similar seeding/competitive level. No clear evidence of skill gap favoring CAG. NO CASE (CAG Osaka): CAG Osaka defeated DplusDK decisively 2-0 on April 10 (5 days more recent than KINOTROPE's last match), with dominant scorelines (52-7 Border, 10-1 Lair). CAG has established MVP depth: ShuReap with 3 tournament MVPs, Chibisu with