ories in 22.5% of matches, while FAVBET achieved 2-0 wins in 35.0% of their matches.", "side_yes_case": ["Acend dominates Anubis with 100% win rate across 6 consecutive map wins", "Acend's 80% Inferno win rate (15 maps) significantly exceeds FAVBET's historical performance baseline", "Acend wins 2-0 at 22.5% rate; FAVBET's 2-0 win rate of 35% suggests more variance and less consistency"], "side_no_case": ["FAVBET achieves 2-0 victories in 35.0% of recent matches\u2014notably higher than Acend's 22.5% rate", "FAVBET shows 75% Inferno win rate on 20 maps, indicating strong performance on the most frequently vetoed map", "FAVBET experiences 0-2 losses in only 10% of matches versus Acend's 27.5% loss rate, suggesting stronger floor"], "key_context": ["BO3 format; match is LIVE as of 2026-04-17 11:00 UTC", "NODWIN Clutch Series #7 is a group stage event with online European competition", "Map pool includes Inferno, Ancient, and Anubis with distinct veto patterns for both teams"], "prior_match_facts": ["2026-04-15 \u2014 Acend vs Ursa on Dust2 and Inferno; Acend won 4-13 on Dust2 (partial/contextual reference from tournament)"], "disambiguation_warnings": [], "data_freshness": "2026-04-17T11:13:38.308478Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "50511395647305309621081308333157329672272890889607281164942737776842353055647", "data_points": 28, "weighted_avg": 0.40547562367154827, "change_1w_pp": -14.500000000000002, "change_24h_pp": -4.0000000000000036, "volatility_24h": 4.565475577797125, "direction": "FALLING", "sharp_moves": [{"timestamp": "2026-04-16T17:00:50Z", "delta_pp": 5.499999999999999}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-17T11:00:43Z", "delta_pp": 9.000000000000002}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-17T11:12:48Z", "delta_pp": -14.500000000000002}]}, "no": {"token_id": "12098225979665053704135459978545793995416598405608583247513026029963794678001", "data_points": 20, "weighted_avg": 0.5858912256310689, "change_1w_pp": 14.500000000000002, "change_24h_pp": 4.0000000000000036, "volatilit