{"run_id": "39a047c0-7c4e-4be8-92db-61d66fa44e82", "timestamp": "2026-04-17T15:35:34.434024+00:00", "legacy": false, "result": {"market": {"id": "1993828", "question": "LoL: E WIE EINFACH E-SPORTS vs Unicorns Of Love Sexy Edition (BO1) - Prime League 1st Division Regular Season", "resolution_criteria": "This market refers to the LoL match between E WIE EINFACH E-SPORTS and Unicorns Of Love Sexy Edition in the Prime League 1st Division Regular Season, initially scheduled for April 17 at 12:00PM ET.\n\nThis market will resolve to \"E WIE EINFACH E-SPORTS\" if E WIE EINFACH E-SPORTS win the match against Unicorns Of Love Sexy Edition.\n\nThis market will resolve to \"Unicorns Of Love Sexy Edition\" if Unicorns Of Love Sexy Edition win the match against E WIE EINFACH E-SPORTS.\n\nIf the match is canceled (not played at all), ends in a tie, or is delayed beyond 7 days from the scheduled date without a winner determined, this market will resolve to 50-50. \n\nIf the match begins but is not completed, and one team wins due to the opponent's forfeiture, disqualification, or walkover, this market will resolve to the team who wins. \n\nIf the match ends in a forfeit, disqualification, or walkover (team withdraws before the start and the other wins automatically), this market will resolve to 50-50. \n\nThe resolution source for this market will be official information from https://gol.gg/esports/home. However, if https://gol.gg/esports/home has not published final results within 2 hours after the event\u2019s conclusion, a consensus of credible reporting may be used instead including video evidence.\n\nIn cases where a team\u2019s listed name includes minor discrepancies from the resolution source, this market will resolve based on the underlying real-world match rather than exact name matching. Recognizable abbreviations, alternate or erroneous spellings, sponsor tags, affiliate or academy designations, regional identifiers, and minor formatting differences will be treated as referring to the same team, provided the intended team can be clearly and uniquely identified within the relevant competition. If a listed team name has no reasonable connection to any participating team, or if it matches or could reasonably refer to another team in the same competition such that the intended team cannot be unambiguously determined, this market will resolve 50-50.", "end_date": "2026-04-17T22:00:00Z", "event_start_time": "2026-04-17T16:00:00Z", "yes_price": 0.38, "volume_usd": 7220.907861, "category": "league-of-legends", "clob_token_ids": ["115117692211973496978562807969747091247291673229300840053833007427846652307498", "81885674136236999754968416189863825503421651239976589537897491552579534567635"], "sports_market_type": "moneyline"}, "verdicts": [{"agent_name": "The Rules Lawyer", "probability": 0.38, "probability_yes": 0.38, "probability_no": 0.62, "probability_source": "independent", "confidence_yes": 0.28, "confidence_no": 0.32, "rationale": "EVENT TIMING: Match is LIVE/IMMINENT (~24 minutes to start at 2026-04-17 16:00 UTC). No new information can materially change the outcome before start. CONDITION CLARITY: Resolution criteria are unambiguous \u2014 market resolves to the team that wins the BO1 match, with clear 50-50 fallback only for cancellation, tie, forfeit before start, or 7+ day delay. RECENT FORM ASYMMETRY: Unicorns Of Love Sexy Edition 6W-4L vs E WIE EINFACH E-SPORTS 5W-5L over last 10 matches. UoL has objectively better recent performance (+1W differential, higher win rate). This alone justifies NO side being favored. HEAD-TO-HEAD DOMINANCE: Unicorns Of Love Sexy Edition 7W-2L lifetime (2023-2026) vs E WIE EINFACH E-SPORTS. UoL has won 7 of 9 prior encounters, including 3 consecutive wins in 2024. Strong predictive signal for NO side. MARKET PRICES CALIBRATED TO DATA: Current prices (YES 38% / NO 62%) closely track the relative strength signals (recent form and H2H). Market odds appear internally consistent with available briefing data. DATA GAPS \u2014 SYMMETRICAL IGNORANCE: Briefing provides NO roster details, meta context, recent roster changes, scrim results, player injuries, or tactical analysis. Both teams suffer equally from missing depth data, so ignorance does not favor either side. CONFIDENCE ASYMMETRY: confidence_yes=28 and confidence_no=32 (both low) reflect data scarcity. The briefing provides only win-loss summaries and historical matchups, not the detailed performance metrics needed for confident probability setting. However, the NO-side evidence (form + H2H) is marginally stronger, justifying slightly higher confidence_no. MARKET PRICE CONTEXT: YES side weighted EMA 35% (7-day) with only +2.5pp gain; NO side EMA 63% with +12.0pp gain over same period. Market sentiment has shifted decisively toward UoL, consistent with their superior form and H2H record. RESOLUTION MECHANISM: gol.gg is authoritative source; fallback to credible reporting + video evidence available. No oracle delay risk material enough to affect probability (per rules: outcome becomes clear at match end, shares trade accordingly before official resolution). PROBABILITY CALIBRATION: probability_score=38 and probability_no_score=62 mirror current market prices, reflecting YES = underdog (E WIE EINFACH) with weaker form and losing H2H record; NO = favored (UoL) with demonstrable competitive edge. These scores represent the briefing evidence, not contrarian positioning.", "key_factor": "Severe data scarcity: no team statistics, meta context, recent roster changes, or competitive form beyond win-loss records prevent meaningful probability calibration; market prices may reflect insider knowledge not visible in briefing."}, {"agent_name": "The Bull", "probability": 0.62, "probability_yes": 0.62, "probability_no": 0.62, "probability_source": "independent", "confidence_yes": 0.35, "confidence_no": 0.35, "rationale": "FAVORED SIDE (NO) STRENGTHS: Unicorns Of Love Sexy Edition holds a commanding 7-2 head-to-head advantage over their last 10 meetings, including a recent win on 2026-02-19. Their 6W-4L form over the last 10 matches outperforms E WIE EINFACH's 5W-5L record by 10 percentage points. MARKET CONSENSUS VALIDATION: NO is priced at 62%, reflecting the H2H advantage and recent form differential. The market has shown strong conviction, with NO gaining +12.0pp over the past week and experiencing sharp upward moves (+5pp, +10pp) on April 16, suggesting informed traders recognize Unicorns' superiority. BO1 VOLATILITY FACTOR: Despite BO1 format introducing inherent randomness, the 7-2 H2H record is substantial enough to overcome single-game variance. Unicorns have beaten E WIE EINFACH consistently across multiple years (2023-2026) and tournament contexts (Regular Season, Playoffs, Group Stage). UNDERDOG (YES) WEAKNESSES: E WIE EINFACH's 5W-5L form is break-even, providing no momentum advantage. Their only two wins in recent H2H were in 2025-05-06 (Regular Season, 2-1) and 2025-02-11 (Group A, 0-2 loss scoreline appears contradictory; likely data artifact). Critically, they have no wins vs Unicorns in the past ~14 months, suggesting tactical or roster disadvantage. COACHING & ROSTER STABILITY: Both teams have established coaching (LeaOne for E WIE EINFACH, Sheepy for Unicorns), but Unicorns' consistent dominance across this multi-year H2H record indicates either superior team cohesion, macro play, or draft advantage. PRICE EFFICIENCY CHECK: The 62% NO price aligns with the strength of evidence. The 7-game H2H lead, 1-game recent form advantage, and week-long price momentum all support the current NO pricing. NO is NOT underpriced; the market appears well-calibrated. IGNORANCE ASYMMETRY: The briefing provides NO case-for-YES or case-for-NO analysis, only form statistics and H2H records. Detailed roster-level, meta, or recent scrim data is absent. This means confidence on both sides is artificially suppressed \u2014 we cannot rule out E WIE EINFACH's meta fit or strategic innovations that might not be visible in raw W-L. TIME-TO-REVERSAL (IMMINENT TIMING): The match begins in ~24 minutes. At this point, significant price movement would require new information (roster changes, technical issues, insider betting). The market has had 7 days to adjust; volatility is now contained (0.9pp/hr for YES, 3.2pp/hr for NO, with NO's spikes already realized). Very unlikely a major reversal occurs in the final minutes without external catalyst. PROBABILITY SYMMETRY REASONING: Both probability_score (62) and probability_no_score (62) are set equal because the briefing's evidence cuts one direction (Unicorns' H2H and form advantage), but provides no explicit counter-case. Confidence is lowered on BOTH sides (35 each) to reflect missing granular analysis (team composition, meta fit, recent scrim results, injury status). The dual probabilities do NOT sum to 100 because ignorance mass (~38pp) is appropriate given data gaps on tactical/player-level details.", "key_factor": "Unicorns Of Love Sexy Edition's dominant head-to-head record (7-2 across all prior encounters) and superior recent form (6W-4L vs 5W-5L) establish them as the clear favorite in a high-variance BO1 format."}, {"agent_name": "The Bear", "probability": 0.41, "probability_yes": 0.41, "probability_no": 0.62, "probability_source": "independent", "confidence_yes": 0.32, "confidence_no": 0.58, "rationale": "UNDERDOG CASE FOR YES (E WIE EINFACH): The market prices E WIE EINFACH at 38% despite a 5W-5L recent form record that is mathematically competitive (50% win rate). Unicorns leads 6W-4L, but only +1 win differential\u2014this is narrow margin for a 62% vs 38% split. RECENT MOMENTUM: YES side has been rising (+2.5pp over 7 days and +2.5pp over 24h), while NO side dropped -2.5pp in last 24h despite overall 7-day rise. This intraday reversal suggests potential mean reversion or last-minute information favoring E WIE EINFACH. HEAD-TO-HEAD VULNERABILITY: Unicorns Of Love dominates long-term H2H (8 wins vs 2