ute roster/tactical news leaking to informed traders. CONFIDENCE ASYMMETRY: YES (NRG) benefits from clear aggregate dominance\u2014confidence in YES at 72% is justified. NO (Blue Otter) confidence capped at 45% because the briefing provides zero evidence of Blue Otter's meta fit, player form trends, or tactical innovation; underdog upsets are real but historically rare without intel. DUAL-PROBABILITY STRUCTURE: Gap between probability_score (76) and probability_no_score (28) reflects 100% shared base evidence (NRG record > Blue Otter record) but diverges on black-swan disruption impact. The same tactical pivot that boosts Blue Otter's win path does NOT symmetrically reduce NRG's win rate\u2014it adds new variance, creating asymmetric uncertainty.", "key_factor": "Blue Otter executes a tactical meta pivot or roster substitution (e.g., flex pick innovation, jungle proximity swap, or support player adaptation) that NRG's recent 4\u20130 run was not prepared for, combined with NRG experiencing first-match pressure/complacency in a BO3 where Blue Otter steals early games to force a reverse sweep."}], "final_score": 0.7247532409676726, "no_score": 0.2637757530708618, "edge": -0.15409090909090906, "no_edge": 0.5359090909090909, "recommendation": "BUY YES", "confidence_level": "HIGH", "signal_type": "LOW MARGIN", "pass_reason": "", "expected_roi": 0.18343195266272194, "perceived_win_rate_at_run": 0.6909090909090909, "kelly_stake_full": 0.33528836754643226, "kelly_stake_scaled": 0.16764418377321613, "kelly_multiplier": 0.5, "agent_weights_snapshot": {"The Rules Lawyer": 1.0502615081746454, "The Bull": 0.9485651334222127, "The Base-Rate Statistician": 1.0530400843938654, "The Sentiment Analyst": 1.0532291381796675, "The Domain Specialist": 1.0546263940607403, "The Contrarian": 1.072388005832532, "The Bear": 0.7678897359363381}, "briefing": {"market": {"id": "1949897", "question": "LoL: NRG Esports vs Blue Otter (BO3) - North American Challengers League Regular Season", "resol