nges Random page.", "Printable version; \"Printable version of this page [p]\").", "Share your feedback in this 2-minute survey.", "| August 18, 2019 - 14:15 CST | Tier 1 | The International 2019 - Day 4-A | OGOG | **1**\u00a0:\u00a0**1** | Vici GamingVG | + Details\") |.", "| May 29, 2019 - 14:20 BST | Tier 2 | ESL One Birmingham 2019 - Series A4 | OGOG | 0\u00a0:\u00a0**2** | Vici GamingVG | + Details\") |.", "| May 23, 2018 - 12:10 BST | Tier 1 | ESL One Birmingham 2018 - Group B | OGOG | **1**\u00a0:\u00a00 | Vici GamingVG | + Details\") |.", "| April 1, 2018 - 16:40 CST | Tier 1 | DAC 2018: Group Stage - Tiebreakers | OGOG | 0\u00a0:\u00a0**1** | Vici GamingVG | + Details\") |.", "| March 29, 2018 - 14:15 CST | Tier 1 | DAC 2018: Group Stage - Mar 29 - A | OGOG | **1**\u00a0:\u00a00 | Vici GamingVG | + Details\") |."], "news_summary": "Team Spirit and Vici Gaming are scheduled to meet in a BO3 match on 2026-04-18 at 07:00 UTC in the PGL Wallachia S7 Group Stage. Team Spirit defeated Vici Gaming 2-0 in their most recent encounter on 2026-03-12. Vici Gaming has shown mixed form in the group stage with a 3-2 record (wins vs XG, Falcons, OG; losses vs Liquid, NAVI), while Team Spirit appears to have strong momentum heading into this matchup.", "side_yes_case": ["Team Spirit won their prior H2H 2-0 on 2026-03-12, demonstrating clear advantage in recent direct competition", "Vici Gaming's group stage record shows inconsistency with losses to tier-1 opponents (Liquid 0-2, NAVI 1-2)", "Team Spirit's recent 2-0 victory indicates superior teamfighting and strategic execution"], "side_no_case": ["Vici Gaming has won 3 of 5 group stage matches, showing resilience and adaptation capability", "Vici Gaming secured victories against strong opponents including OG (2-1), XG (2-1), and Falcons (2-1)", "BO3 format allows Vici Gaming to adjust strategy between games after the prior 0-2 loss"], "key_context": ["PGL Wallachia S7 Group Stage \u2014 ongoing round-robin format with multiple teams competing", "This match is the second group stage encounter between these teams within the same tournament", "Vici Gaming's recent group stage performance (5 matches in 5 days, March 7-11) shows tournament endurance"], "prior_match_facts": ["2026-03-12 \u2014 winner: Team Spirit (2-0) @ Playoffs"], "disambiguation_warnings": ["Past-tense match-result language detected in news_summary, side_yes_case[2], side_no_case[2] despite PandaScore reports this match as scheduled (scheduled 2026-04-18 07:00 UTC). Sample: \"Stage. Team Spirit defeated Vici Gaming 2-0 in their most recen\". Treat any final scoreline as a PRIOR encounter, not this market's outcome."], "data_freshness": "2026-04-17T19:55:44.932951Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "31969159059587620120792875967720476769566644819991227763354723870199265223803", "data_points": 12, "weighted_avg": 0.6547051272275597, "change_1w_pp": -3.0000000000000027, "change_24h_pp": -3.0000000000000027, "volatility_24h": 0.8474560862851948, "direction": "FALLING", "sharp_moves": []}, "no": {"token_id": "95408386544260833209142389954193027550326930706906239732237232137184576000387", "data_points": 23, "weighted_avg": 0.3374095914455475, "change_1w_pp": 12.499999999999996, "change_24h_pp": 12.499999999999996, "volatility_24h": 1.8080208499736372, "direction": "RISING", "sharp_moves": [{"timestamp": "2026-04-16T21:00:28Z", "delta_pp": 7.999999999999999}]}, "fetched_at": "2026-04-17T19:55:45.243506Z"}, "structured_match": {"provider": "pandascore", "provider_match_id": "1449766", "game": "dota2", "scheduled_at": "2026-04-18T07:00:00Z", "status": "scheduled", "team_a_name": "Team Spirit", "team_b_name": "Vici Gaming", "match_format": "BO3", "tournament_name": "Group Stage", "final_score": null, "winner_name": null, "h2h": [{"match_id": "1387090", "scheduled_at": "2026-03-12T10:25:00Z", "winner_name": "Team Spirit", "score_summary": "2-0", "tournament_name": "Playoffs"}], "team_a_recent_form": {"team_name": "Team Spiri