6 Split 1 with a 60% win rate (15-10 record) and reached the playoffs, demonstrating mid-tier strength in the league. Invictus Gaming struggled significantly in Split 1, posting only a 28% win rate (7-18) and ranking near the bottom of the standings, indicating major form concerns heading into this encounter.", "side_yes_case": ["Bilibili Gaming has won 3 of the last 4 head-to-head meetings, including two consecutive 2-0 sweeps (Jan 31, Jan 20, 2026)", "Bilibili Gaming achieved 60% win rate in Split 1 with strong playmaking from mid-laner Knight (70.7% KDA efficiency) and jungler XUN (69.7% efficiency)", "Invictus Gaming's abysmal 28% win rate (7-18) in Split 1 suggests systemic team issues that likely persist into Split 2", "Bilibili Gaming's bot laner Viper demonstrated high performance in Split 1 playoffs (8.4 KDA) with diverse champion pool (9 different ADCs played)"], "side_no_case": ["Invictus Gaming won 2 of 5 recent head-to-head matches, including one 2-0 victory (Aug 28, 2025) and a 1-2 victory (Aug 18, 2025)", "Early-season form volatility is common in LoL; Invictus Gaming's bottom-tier Split 1 record may not fully predict Split 2 performance if roster or coaching adjustments were made"], "key_context": ["LPL 2026 Split 2 runs April\u2013June 2026 as an offline tournament with 14 teams competing", "This is a Group Ascend regular-season match within Split 2, not a playoff encounter with elimination stakes", "Bilibili Gaming reached Split 1 playoffs (evident from playoff stats provided), suggesting organizational stability", "Match format is BO3, reducing variance compared to BO1 but still allowing upset potential"], "prior_match_facts": ["2026-01-31 \u2014 winner: Bilibili Gaming (2-0) @ Group Ascend", "2026-01-20 \u2014 winner: Bilibili Gaming (0-2) @ Group Ascend", "2025-09-09 \u2014 winner: Bilibili Gaming (1-3) @ Playoffs", "2025-08-28 \u2014 winner: Invictus Gaming (2-0) @ Group Ascend", "2025-08-18 \u2014 winner: Invictus Gaming (1-2) @ Group Ascend",