d Minds PH and TNC Pro Team this season", "Omega show execution gaps in BO3 series play across multiple losses"], "side_no_case": ["Aurora lost 0-2 to ONIC Philippines on April 12, showing vulnerability to strong teams", "Aurora's 2-3 record (50% win rate) leaves room for upset in single BO3 matchup", "Omega could exploit Aurora's recent form dip after consecutive losses to top teams", "BO3 format allows for variance; Omega's roster stability may enable competitive play"], "key_context": ["MPL Philippines Season 17 double round-robin Regular Season (March 20 \u2013 May 17, 2026); top 6 teams advance to playoffs", "All matches are best-of-3 format; 1 point for win, 0 for loss", "Aurora are positioned solidly for playoff advancement despite current record", "Omega face relegation risk at 7th place, increasing desperation factor", "Stable rosters for both teams; ongoing patch meta consistent across season"], "prior_match_facts": ["2025-10-11 \u2014 winner: Aurora Gaming PH (2-0) @ Regular Season", "2025-09-13 \u2014 winner: Aurora Gaming PH (1-2) @ Regular Season", "2025-04-26 \u2014 winner: Aurora Gaming PH (2-0) @ Regular Season", "2025-03-15 \u2014 winner: Aurora Gaming PH (1-2) @ Regular Season", "2024-09-14 \u2014 winner: Omega Esports (1-2) @ Regular Season", "2024-08-25 \u2014 winner: Aurora Gaming PH (1-2) @ Regular Season"], "disambiguation_warnings": [], "data_freshness": "2026-04-17T21:36:08.213523Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "103369465516676534904779520143794240651257939545288417696414131830093518454077", "data_points": 25, "weighted_avg": 0.7883087905573143, "change_1w_pp": 27.0, "change_24h_pp": 17.000000000000004, "volatility_24h": 1.0768118728560732, "direction": "RISING", "sharp_moves": [{"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:00:02Z", "delta_pp": 23.5}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-16T21:00:59Z", "delta_pp": -15.000000000000002}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-17T01:00:49Z", "delta_pp": 15.000000000000002}]}, "no": {"token_id": "1030349586228962285902219081584885