 (2-0 wins), and roster investment, but is underweighted in market odds. CONFIDENCE ASYMMETRY: confidence_yes=72 reflects strong historical data and market consensus, but downgraded 10-15 points due to stale H2H data and poor current form contradiction. confidence_no=60 reflects weaker direct evidence (no 2026 H2H, recent wins only vs mid-tier teams), but solid form metrics warrant more credibility than 19% market price suggests. OVERALL ASSESSMENT: ENTERPRISE retains edge due to historical head-to-head record and proven roster quality, but current form disparity (2W-8L vs 5W-5L) creates material uncertainty. Market pricing appears to overweight Sept 2025 results; adjusted probability reflects that ENTERPRISE is likely favored but not overwhelmingly so given 2026 context.", "key_factor": "Recent head-to-head data is from September 2025 (7 months prior); 2026 roster changes and current tournament form may not be fully reflected in historical matchups; Man eSports LFO's recent 2-0 playoff victories suggest improved trajectory that contradicts the strong YES market pricing."}, {"agent_name": "The Bull", "probability": 0.78, "probability_yes": 0.78, "probability_no": 0.22, "probability_source": "independent", "confidence_yes": 0.72, "confidence_no": 0.35, "rationale": "MARKET SIGNAL: YES side priced at 82% with strong 7-day uptrend (+31pp), driven by late Apr 18 volatility spike (+14.5pp, -13pp, +9pp). Sharp moves suggest informed traders backing ENTERPRISE in final hours before match. HEAD-TO-HEAD ADVANTAGE (MAJOR): ENTERPRISE won both 2025 encounters decisively (Sept 30: 2-1, Sept 4: 1-0). These are legitimate prior H2H data points, not this match's outcome. Current form in 2026 has not yet produced a direct rematch. FORM MISMATCH (CRITICAL): ENTERPRISE's recent 10-match record is 2W-8L, appearing weak. However, Man eSports LFO is 5W-5L\u2014only marginally better and against weaker opponents (Shaiikademy 2-0 on Apr 12, Rock 2-0 on Mar 29). ENTERPRISE's recent losses 